(168,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',5,'Speaking of which','말이 나온 김에','화제를 전환하는 Speaking of which','앞에 나온 이야기를 받아서 ''말이 나온 김에'', ''그러고 보니''라며 자연스럽게 화제를 이어가는 표현입니다. 대화의 흐름을 부드럽게 만들어주는 윤활유 같은 표현이에요.','I''m planning a trip to Japan soon.','곧 일본 여행 계획 중이야.','Speaking of which, how was your trip?','말 나온 김에, 여행 어땠어?',ARRAY['Speaking','of','which','how','was','your','trip']::varchar[],ARRAY['how','what','were','trip','your','of','Speaking','Speak','was','which']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Speaking of which, did you finish that book?", "highlightingPart": "Speaking of which", "sentenceTranslation": "그러고 보니, 그 책 다 읽었어?", "practiceQuestion": "The new bookstore downtown is huge.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "시내에 새로 생긴 서점 엄청 크더라.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/168/practice-examples/38b24d24-ba03-43ac-899d-7066f8dd285d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Speaking", "of", "which", "did", "you", "finish", "that", "book"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["that", "finish", "did", "finished", "Speaking", "book", "this", "of", "you", "which", "Spoken"]}, {"sentenceText": "Speaking of food, I''m starving.", "highlightingPart": "Speaking of", "sentenceTranslation": "음식 얘기 나온 김에 말인데, 나 배고파 죽겠어.", "practiceQuestion": "That cooking show last night was amazing.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "어제 그 요리 프로그램 진짜 대단하더라.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/168/practice-examples/f888c150-f9dc-406d-9fb9-759219160e06.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Speaking", "of", "food", "I''m", "starving"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I''m", "starve", "starving", "food", "Speak", "Speaking", "of"]}, {"sentenceText": "Speaking of which, we should book the tickets soon.", "highlightingPart": "Speaking of which", "sentenceTranslation": "말 나온 김에, 표 빨리 예매해야겠다.", "practiceQuestion": "Everyone''s talking about that musical these days.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "요즘 다들 그 뮤지컬 얘기하더라.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/con