(183,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',20,'call for','~을 필요로 하다, ~할 만하다','당위성을 전달하는 call for','''~을 필요로 하다'', ''~할 만하다''라는 뜻으로, 어떤 상황이 특정 행동을 요구한다고 말할 때 씁니다. This calls for a celebration처럼 좋은 일에 특히 자주 쓰여요.','I finally passed the exam!','나 드디어 시험 붙었어!','This calls for a celebration!','이건 축하할 일이지!',ARRAY['This','calls','for','a','celebration']::varchar[],ARRAY['celebrate','This','celebration','a','to','calls','for','call']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "You got the job? That calls for champagne!", "highlightingPart": "calls for", "sentenceTranslation": "취직했다고? 샴페인 터뜨려야지!", "practiceQuestion": "I just heard back — they want me to start Monday!", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "방금 연락 왔는데, 나 월요일부터 출근하래!", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/183/practice-examples/f1b0bab0-ac36-4f2d-83a0-2b84282fb8fc.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You", "got", "the", "job", "That", "calls", "for", "champagne"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["got", "job", "get", "calls", "at", "call", "the", "for", "That", "champagne", "You"]}, {"sentenceText": "This situation calls for a different approach.", "highlightingPart": "calls for", "sentenceTranslation": "이 상황엔 다른 접근이 필요해.", "practiceQuestion": "We''ve already tried the same fix three times.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "같은 방법을 벌써 세 번이나 써봤잖아.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/183/practice-examples/3f301e9a-4941-4422-b6ca-9a7584da2725.webp", "sentenceWords": ["This", "situation", "calls", "for", "a", "different", "approach"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["for", "This", "a", "different", "differently", "calls", "calling", "approach", "situation", "approaches"]}, {"sentenceText": "The recipe calls for two eggs.", "highlightingPart": "calls for", "sentenceTranslation": "레시피에 달걀 두 개가 필요하대.", "practiceQuestion": "What do we need for the pancakes?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "팬케이크 만들려면 뭐 필요해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/183/practi