(199,NULL,'GRAMMAR_FUNCTION_WORD','BASIC','EN','KR',36,'unusual / unusually','흔치 않은, 이례적으로','일반적이지 않음을 말하는 unusual / unusually','unusual은 ''흔치 않은'', unusually는 ''이례적으로''라는 뜻으로, 보통과 다른 상황을 표현합니다. unusually expensive처럼 형용사 앞에 붙여 정도가 특이함을 강조해요.','How''s the weather this April?','이번 4월 날씨 어때?','It''s unusually cold for April.','4월치고는 이례적으로 춥네.',ARRAY['It''s','unusually','cold','for','April']::varchar[],ARRAY['in','cold','unusually','April','for','coldly','It''s','unusual']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "It''s unusual for him to be late.", "highlightingPart": "unusual", "sentenceTranslation": "걔가 늦다니 흔치 않은 일이야.", "practiceQuestion": "He''s still not here. It''s already twenty minutes past.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 아직도 안 왔어. 벌써 20분이나 지났는데.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/199/practice-examples/8a623cff-3647-41cc-9400-509905222646.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "unusual", "for", "him", "to", "be", "late"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["be", "unusually", "to", "for", "late", "he", "unusual", "It''s", "him", "lately"]}, {"sentenceText": "The streets were unusually quiet.", "highlightingPart": "unusually", "sentenceTranslation": "거리가 이상하리만치 조용했어.", "practiceQuestion": "How was downtown last night?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "어젯밤 시내 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/199/practice-examples/7381453a-ab8e-40b8-a6fd-bec540703999.webp", "sentenceWords": ["The", "streets", "were", "unusually", "quiet"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["unusual", "streets", "unusually", "was", "were", "quiet", "quietly", "The"]}, {"sentenceText": "She has an unusual name.", "highlightingPart": "unusual", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 이름이 특이해.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do people always ask her to repeat her name?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "왜 사람들이 걔 이름을 자꾸 되물어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/199/practice-examples/861628d7-89ec-4d20-b980-67c62c54b9b4.webp", "senten