(201,NULL,'GRAMMAR_FUNCTION_WORD','BASIC','EN','KR',38,'what you ~','네가 ~한 것','명사절로 자연스럽게 말하는 what you ~','what이 이끄는 명사절을 목적어로 쓰면 ''네가 ~한 것''을 통째로 표현할 수 있습니다. I like what you did(네가 한 거 마음에 들어)처럼 문장이 한층 원어민스러워져요.','Do you notice anything different about me?','나 뭐 달라진 거 없어?','I like what you did with your hair.','너 머리 바꾼 거 마음에 든다.',ARRAY['I','like','what','you','did','with','your','hair']::varchar[],ARRAY['hair','your','that','what','with','did','done','like','you','I','hairs']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I heard what you said.", "highlightingPart": "what you said", "sentenceTranslation": "네가 한 말 들었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry, forget it. It was nothing.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "미안, 신경 쓰지 마. 아무것도 아니야.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/201/practice-examples/59bd4b49-48f1-45fe-8d92-dcd32ab33559.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "heard", "what", "you", "said"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["says", "heard", "I", "said", "what", "that", "you"]}, {"sentenceText": "Show me what you bought.", "highlightingPart": "what you bought", "sentenceTranslation": "뭐 샀는지 보여줘.", "practiceQuestion": "I went a little crazy at the mall today.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 오늘 쇼핑몰에서 좀 질렀어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/201/practice-examples/124bd538-6745-4ee0-9728-dcdf2f1758f2.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Show", "me", "what", "you", "bought"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Show", "buys", "my", "that", "you", "what", "bought", "me"]}, {"sentenceText": "That''s exactly what I needed.", "highlightingPart": "what I needed", "sentenceTranslation": "그게 딱 내가 필요했던 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "I made you some hot tea.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 주려고 따뜻한 차 좀 탔어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/201/practice-examples/7c4b066a-26d7-448c-bbcb-5ba87ffb69a2.webp", "sentenceWords": ["That''s", "exactly", "what", "I", "needed"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["what", "exact", "whi