(206,NULL,'GRAMMAR_FUNCTION_WORD','BASIC','EN','KR',43,'quite','꽤; (not quite) 완전히 ~하진 않은','말의 강약을 조절하는 quite','quite는 ''꽤''라는 강조와 not quite(완전히 ~하진 않은)라는 완화, 두 방향으로 쓰이는 조절 장치입니다. not quite sure(확실치는 않은)처럼 단정을 피하는 데 특히 유용해요.','Are you ready to go?','나갈 준비 됐어?','I''m not quite ready yet.','아직 완전히 준비가 안 됐어.',ARRAY['I''m','not','quite','ready','yet']::varchar[],ARRAY['ready','quiet','quite','not','I''m','already','yet']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "The movie was quite good.", "highlightingPart": "quite", "sentenceTranslation": "그 영화 꽤 괜찮았어.", "practiceQuestion": "You saw that new movie, right? How was it?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 그 새 영화 봤다며? 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/206/practice-examples/0ee19690-29c6-4d4e-94d3-150f2d5bd45d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["The", "movie", "was", "quite", "good"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["was", "quite", "well", "good", "quiet", "were", "movie", "The"]}, {"sentenceText": "That''s not quite what I meant.", "highlightingPart": "quite", "sentenceTranslation": "내 말은 정확히 그게 아니야.", "practiceQuestion": "So you''re saying we should cancel the whole project?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그러니까 프로젝트를 아예 접자는 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/206/practice-examples/10253b20-b3b7-49c9-a08d-d7afdaba21cd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["That''s", "not", "quite", "what", "I", "meant"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["meant", "what", "quiet", "not", "quite", "That''s", "I", "means"]}, {"sentenceText": "I don''t quite understand.", "highlightingPart": "quite", "sentenceTranslation": "완전히 이해가 되진 않아요.", "practiceQuestion": "Any questions about the new policy?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "새 정책에 대해 질문 있으신가요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/206/practice-examples/5108d627-2a3b-4d85-a4dc-c92487b95cc9.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "don''t", "quite", "understand"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["understands", "quite", "don''t", "doesn''t", "I", "quiet", "understand"]}, {"sentenceText": "We''re not quite finished.", "highlightingPart": "quite", "sentenceTranslation": "아직 다 끝난 건 아니야.", "practiceQuestion": "Can we wrap up and go grab dinner?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이제 마무리하고 저녁 먹으러 갈까?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/206/practice-examples/a809441d-b1e1-4e99-9605-6ad32ac416d0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["We''re", "not", "quite", "finished"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["finished", "We''re", "finish", "quiet", "quite", "not"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0239562988,0.0188446045,-0.0872192383,-0.00268173218,-0.000494003296,0.0301513672,-0.0194549561,0.0152511597,0.00526046753,0.0267181396,0.0297241211,-0.00834655762,-0.0192718506,0.0305328369,0.00283432007,0.0240478516,-0.0179595947,0.00467681885,0.0332641602,0.0182952881,0.00307846069,-0.0107727051,0.0101699829,0.0382080078,-0.0001527071,0.0222015381,0.0225067139,0.00463485718,0.0181884766,-0.0649414062,0.0203399658,-0.0319824219,0.0181884766,-0.0602416992,-0.0136795044,-0.00236320496,0.0400085449,-0.0409240723,-0.00825500488,-0.0850830078,-0.00576019287,-0.0317382812,-0.0243682861,0.0151138306,0.0469665527,0.0382385254,0.0235290527,0.0514526367,0.0182342529,-0.0105819702,-0.046295166,0.0219421387,-0.00793457031,0.00787353516,0.0176544189,-0.00737762451,-0.0109863281,-0.0194091797,0.0740966797,-0.00827026367,0.0266876221,-0.0876464844,0.00862884521,0.0158843994,-0.039276123,-0.0286254883,0.0020942688,0.025680542,-0.0208129883,-0.0149765015,0.000130534172,-0.0365600586,-0.0841064453,0.0195465088,-0.018157959,-0.0256347656,0.00699996948,0.0261383057,-0.00276565552,0.0027961731,-0.00925445557,0.000646591187,-0.000399827957,-0.0446472168,-0.00399398804,-0.0488586426,-0.0578613281,0.0815429688,-0.00413894653,-0.0266876221,0.0280456543,0.0532226562,-0.00782775879,0.00158119202,0.0241851807,-0.00626373291,-0.0580444336,0.0600280762,-0.00693893433,0.0381774902,0.0350341797,-0.00975036621,0.013908