(220,NULL,'DAILY_ROUTINE','BASIC','EN','KR',57,'wind down','긴장을 풀다','긴장을 푸는 wind down','''긴장을 풀다'', ''하루를 마무리하며 쉬다''라는 뜻입니다. 바쁜 하루 끝에 서서히 이완되는 느낌을 담고 있어서 저녁 루틴 얘기에 딱이에요.','How do you relax at night?','밤에 어떻게 쉬어?','I like to wind down with a book before bed.','자기 전에 책 읽으면서 긴장을 풀어.',ARRAY['I','like','to','wind','down','with','a','book','before','bed']::varchar[],ARRAY['books','bed','I','with','winds','wind','down','before','book','a','to','like','likes']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Tea helps me wind down at night.", "highlightingPart": "wind down", "sentenceTranslation": "밤엔 차가 긴장 푸는 데 도움이 돼.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you always brew something before bed?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "넌 왜 자기 전에 항상 뭘 끓여?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/220/practice-examples/36ba8fb9-ce47-4733-bcfe-8bcb2ccad9a3.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Tea", "helps", "me", "wind", "down", "at", "night"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["nights", "at", "down", "wind", "night", "winds", "Tea", "helps", "help", "me"]}, {"sentenceText": "Let''s wind down with some quiet music.", "highlightingPart": "wind down", "sentenceTranslation": "조용한 음악 들으면서 좀 쉬자.", "practiceQuestion": "What a hectic day that was.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "오늘 진짜 정신없는 하루였다.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/220/practice-examples/fe012bb4-8225-4750-bbe3-5cd5c3c0349e.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Let''s", "wind", "down", "with", "some", "quiet", "music"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["quietly", "music", "with", "wind", "quiet", "some", "winds", "down", "Lets", "Let''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "It takes me an hour to wind down after work.", "highlightingPart": "wind down", "sentenceTranslation": "퇴근 후에 긴장 푸는 데 한 시간은 걸려.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you go straight to bed after your shift?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "퇴근하면 바로 자?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/220/practice-examples/b1460867-7151-47cc-8ddf-013326d3c5