(222,NULL,'WORK_STUDY','BASIC','EN','KR',59,'pay off','(빚을) 갚다; 결실을 맺다','빚을 청산하는 pay off','''(빚을) 다 갚다''라는 뜻과 ''(노력이) 결실을 맺다''라는 뜻을 모두 가진 구동사입니다. 대출 상환과 노력의 보상, 두 가지 맥락 모두 자주 쓰여요.','Why did he get promoted?','걔 왜 승진했어?','All that hard work paid off.','그 고생이 다 결실을 맺었네.',ARRAY['All','that','hard','work','paid','off']::varchar[],ARRAY['All','pay','hard','hardly','paid','off','work','works','that']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "We paid off the car last month.", "highlightingPart": "paid off", "sentenceTranslation": "지난달에 차 할부를 다 갚았어.", "practiceQuestion": "Are you still making payments on your car?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "차 할부 아직 내고 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/222/practice-examples/d7501c28-34d8-4de1-b4bd-85863af5a8c4.webp", "sentenceWords": ["We", "paid", "off", "the", "car", "last", "month"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["the", "cars", "paid", "off", "month", "car", "last", "We", "pay", "months"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''ll take ten years to pay off the mortgage.", "highlightingPart": "pay off", "sentenceTranslation": "주택 대출 갚는 데 10년은 걸릴 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Congrats on the new house!", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "새집 산 거 축하해!", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/222/practice-examples/b541353f-8ade-47bf-9219-3b35d9141ba1.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''ll", "take", "ten", "years", "to", "pay", "off", "the", "mortgage"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["takes", "take", "It''ll", "year", "the", "pays", "ten", "years", "off", "pay", "mortgage", "to"]}, {"sentenceText": "Her patience finally paid off.", "highlightingPart": "paid off", "sentenceTranslation": "걔의 인내가 마침내 빛을 발했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did she ever hear back about the promotion?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 승진 소식 결국 들었대?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/222/practice-examples/fa039041-729c-4d79-ac31-e767d20376a7.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Her", "patience", "finally", "pai