(226,NULL,'MONEY_SPENDING','BASIC','EN','KR',63,'give away','공짜로 나눠주다','공짜로 나눠주는 give away','''공짜로 나눠주다, 거저 주다''라는 뜻입니다. 무료 증정 이벤트를 giveaway라고 부르는 것도 여기서 나왔어요.','Why is there a crowd over there?','저기 왜 사람이 몰려 있어?','They''re giving away free samples.','무료 샘플을 나눠주고 있어.',ARRAY['They''re','giving','away','free','samples']::varchar[],ARRAY['give','They''re','free','away','samples','freely','sample','giving']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I gave away my old furniture.", "highlightingPart": "gave away", "sentenceTranslation": "안 쓰는 가구를 그냥 나눠줬어.", "practiceQuestion": "Your room looks so much emptier than before.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네 방 전보다 훨씬 휑하다.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/226/practice-examples/589ee851-d19d-43f3-9cb9-dd1504c502f9.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "gave", "away", "my", "old", "furniture"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["give", "old", "away", "I", "gave", "mine", "way", "my", "furniture"]}, {"sentenceText": "The store is giving away tote bags today.", "highlightingPart": "giving away", "sentenceTranslation": "그 가게 오늘 에코백 나눠준대.", "practiceQuestion": "Where did you get that cute bag?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 귀여운 가방 어디서 났어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/226/practice-examples/0cbe3d94-445f-428a-9599-423e3559698d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["The", "store", "is", "giving", "away", "tote", "bags", "today"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["The", "is", "stores", "bag", "store", "giving", "bags", "tote", "today", "away", "give"]}, {"sentenceText": "Don''t give away the ending!", "highlightingPart": "give away", "sentenceTranslation": "결말 스포하지 마!", "practiceQuestion": "I just finished the finale. You won''t believe what happens.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 마지막 화 방금 다 봤는데, 무슨 일이 일어나는지 넌 상상도 못 할걸.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/226/practice-examples/7f0dec07-b7d8-4f52-aaec-f25c41edea88.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Don''t", "g