(234,NULL,'DAILY_ROUTINE','BASIC','EN','KR',71,'take apart','분해하다, 해체하다','분해하는 take apart','''분해하다, 해체하다''라는 뜻으로, 조립의 반대 동작을 표현합니다. 조립은 put together라는 것도 세트로 기억해 두면 좋아요.','What did your brother do with the old computer?','형이 낡은 컴퓨터 어떻게 했어?','He took apart the old computer.','걔가 낡은 컴퓨터를 분해했어.',ARRAY['He','took','apart','the','old','computer']::varchar[],ARRAY['apart','computer','the','He','takes','part','took','old']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I had to take the desk apart to move it.", "highlightingPart": "take the desk apart", "sentenceTranslation": "책상을 옮기려고 분해해야 했어.", "practiceQuestion": "How did you get that thing through the narrow doorway?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 좁은 문으로 그걸 어떻게 통과시켰어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/234/practice-examples/0b49ed36-e810-42ed-8d1c-4b58c4826f73.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "had", "to", "take", "the", "desk", "apart", "to", "move", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["the", "I", "it", "take", "to", "have", "takes", "desk", "had", "to", "apart", "move", "moves"]}, {"sentenceText": "Don''t take it apart — you won''t be able to put it back.", "highlightingPart": "take it apart", "sentenceTranslation": "분해하지 마. 다시 못 맞출 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "I want to see what''s inside this radio.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이 라디오 안이 어떻게 생겼는지 보고 싶어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/234/practice-examples/488fc13a-a15d-43d3-ae5e-11955cfcf0fe.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Don''t", "take", "it", "apart", "you", "won''t", "be", "able", "to", "put", "it", "back"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["apart", "be", "Don''t", "back", "puts", "it", "take", "won''t", "able", "you", "put", "to", "backs", "takes", "it"]}, {"sentenceText": "The mechanic took the engine apart.", "highlightingPart": "took the engine apart", "sentenceTranslation": "정비사가 엔진을 분해했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Why is your car still at the shop?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네 차 왜 아직도 정비소에 있어?", "ima