(235,NULL,'TRAVEL_MOVEMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',72,'take off','이륙하다; 벗다; 급성장하다','이륙하는 take off','''(비행기가) 이륙하다''라는 뜻이 기본이고, ''(옷을) 벗다'', ''(일이) 급성장하다''로도 쓰이는 다재다능한 구동사입니다.','What time is your flight?','비행기 몇 시야?','The flight takes off at 9.','비행기는 9시에 이륙해.',ARRAY['The','flight','takes','off','at','9']::varchar[],ARRAY['take','flight','takes','9','at','off','flights','The','of']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Please turn off your phone before we take off.", "highlightingPart": "take off", "sentenceTranslation": "이륙 전에 핸드폰을 꺼주세요.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry, I''m on the plane now. I''ll text you soon.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "미안, 나 지금 비행기야. 이따 문자할게.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/235/practice-examples/f4dee5c3-87d1-4745-a1e5-d63111a878e6.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Please", "turn", "off", "your", "phone", "before", "we", "take", "off"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["turn", "phone", "take", "before", "your", "of", "off", "Please", "turns", "takes", "we", "off"]}, {"sentenceText": "Take off your shoes at the door.", "highlightingPart": "Take off", "sentenceTranslation": "문 앞에서 신발 벗어줘.", "practiceQuestion": "Hi! Should I come right in?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "안녕! 바로 들어가면 돼?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/235/practice-examples/7f1bc05c-adf6-48ca-8cac-3642ddaad733.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Take", "off", "your", "shoes", "at", "the", "door"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Takes", "at", "the", "Take", "off", "shoes", "of", "your", "yours", "door"]}, {"sentenceText": "Her business really took off last year.", "highlightingPart": "took off", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 사업이 작년에 완전 떴어.", "practiceQuestion": "How can she afford that fancy new car?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 그 비싼 새 차 살 돈이 어디서 났대?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/235/practice-examples/014dbccd-079a-4c25-a1aa-9ea2726c95d8.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Her", "business", "really", "