(240,NULL,'TRAVEL_MOVEMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',77,'cut ~ off','(차가) 끼어들다, (말을) 끊다','끼어드는 차를 말하는 cut ~ off','''(차가) 끼어들다'', ''(말을) 끊다''라는 뜻입니다. 운전 중 갑자기 앞으로 끼어드는 차, 또는 대화 중 말을 자르는 사람 모두에게 쓸 수 있어요.','Why are you honking?','왜 경적을 울려?','That truck just cut me off!','저 트럭이 방금 내 앞에 확 끼어들었어!',ARRAY['That','truck','just','cut','me','off']::varchar[],ARRAY['cuts','just','me','my','truck','trucks','off','That','cut']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "He cut me off in the middle of my sentence.", "highlightingPart": "cut me off", "sentenceTranslation": "걔가 내 말을 중간에 잘랐어.", "practiceQuestion": "How did your talk with him go?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔랑 얘기 잘 됐어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/240/practice-examples/37d8b9bc-06ce-4547-bca3-5ba3e6297bbd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["He", "cut", "me", "off", "in", "the", "middle", "of", "my", "sentence"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["of", "in", "my", "me", "He", "middles", "I", "cut", "the", "off", "sentence", "middle", "cuts"]}, {"sentenceText": "Someone cut us off and almost caused an accident.", "highlightingPart": "cut us off", "sentenceTranslation": "어떤 차가 끼어들어서 사고 날 뻔했어.", "practiceQuestion": "You look shaken. What happened on the way here?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 얼굴이 창백해. 오는 길에 무슨 일 있었어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/240/practice-examples/3859a459-abd5-419d-9fb9-778af7d32eed.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Someone", "cut", "us", "off", "and", "almost", "caused", "an", "accident"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Someone", "and", "cuts", "caused", "an", "cut", "accident", "we", "accidents", "almost", "off", "us"]}, {"sentenceText": "Don''t cut people off when they''re talking.", "highlightingPart": "cut people off", "sentenceTranslation": "사람들이 말할 때 끊지 마.", "practiceQuestion": "Why did everyone look annoyed at me during the meeting?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "회의 때 왜 다들 나한테 짜증 난 표정이었지?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net