(264,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','BASIC','EN','KR',101,'hang in there','조금만 버텨, 포기하지 마','버티라고 응원하는 hang in there','''조금만 버텨'', ''포기하지 마''라는 뜻의 응원 표현입니다. 힘든 시기를 지나는 사람에게 건네는 가장 캐주얼하고 따뜻한 격려 한마디예요.','This semester is killing me.','이번 학기 진짜 죽겠어.','Hang in there. It''ll get better.','조금만 버텨. 나아질 거야.',ARRAY['Hang','in','there','It''ll','get','better']::varchar[],ARRAY['there','hangs','better','It''ll','Hang','get','their','gets','in']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Finals are almost over. Hang in there!", "highlightingPart": "Hang in there", "sentenceTranslation": "기말고사 거의 끝났어. 조금만 힘내!", "practiceQuestion": "I still have three exams left this week.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 이번 주에 시험이 세 개나 남았어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/264/practice-examples/5d207bdf-b98e-450b-8256-5cad39bdf630.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Finals", "are", "almost", "over", "Hang", "in", "there"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["almost", "Hang", "is", "are", "in", "their", "there", "hangs", "over", "Finals"]}, {"sentenceText": "I know it''s tough, but hang in there.", "highlightingPart": "hang in there", "sentenceTranslation": "힘든 거 알아, 그래도 버텨보자.", "practiceQuestion": "This new job is wearing me out.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "새 직장이 나를 너무 지치게 해.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/264/practice-examples/173397f2-6b4f-423f-9dca-dc8dbdb3c882.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "know", "it''s", "tough", "but", "hang", "in", "there"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it''s", "there", "knows", "know", "but", "their", "hangs", "I", "tough", "in", "hang"]}, {"sentenceText": "She''s hanging in there despite everything.", "highlightingPart": "hanging in there", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 그 와중에도 잘 버티고 있어.", "practiceQuestion": "How''s she holding up after the breakup?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 이별하고 좀 어때?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/264/practice-examples/6c184832-27c7-459e-893b-17e8afe0bd3