(268,NULL,'RELATIONSHIP_SOCIAL','BASIC','EN','KR',105,'break the ice','어색한 분위기를 풀다','어색함을 깨는 break the ice','''얼음을 깨다'', 즉 처음 만난 자리의 어색한 분위기를 풀다라는 뜻입니다. 어색함을 깨는 용도의 농담이나 게임은 icebreaker라고 불러요.','How did he start the meeting?','걔가 회의를 어떻게 시작했어?','He told a joke to break the ice.','걔가 분위기 풀려고 농담을 던졌어.',ARRAY['He','told','a','joke','to','break','the','ice']::varchar[],ARRAY['break','He','ices','to','ice','a','the','breaks','joke','tell','told']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Small talk helps break the ice.", "highlightingPart": "break the ice", "sentenceTranslation": "스몰토크가 어색함 깨는 데 도움이 돼.", "practiceQuestion": "What should I say to my new coworkers?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "새 동료들한테 무슨 말을 해야 하지?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/268/practice-examples/d9034964-5f3e-4aa9-8282-4d0cb4fd7aad.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Small", "talk", "helps", "break", "the", "ice"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["break", "Small", "helps", "ices", "the", "talk", "help", "breaks", "ice"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s hard to break the ice with strangers.", "highlightingPart": "break the ice", "sentenceTranslation": "처음 보는 사람들이랑 어색함 깨기가 어려워.", "practiceQuestion": "Why don''t you like networking events?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "넌 왜 네트워킹 행사를 안 좋아해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/268/practice-examples/3d535e2f-f8da-4eec-9945-ac226f580a1f.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "hard", "to", "break", "the", "ice", "with", "strangers"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["the", "hard", "breaks", "stranger", "ice", "with", "break", "to", "hardly", "strangers", "It''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "The game was a great way to break the ice.", "highlightingPart": "break the ice", "sentenceTranslation": "그 게임이 서먹함을 푸는 데 아주 좋았어.", "practiceQuestion": "How was the team-building workshop?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "팀워크숍은 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/268/practice-examples/41627e5a-6a73-