(275,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',112,'beat around the bush','핵심을 피해 빙빙 돌려 말하다','빙빙 돌려 말하는 beat around the bush','''덤불 주변만 두드리다'', 즉 ''핵심을 피해 빙빙 돌려 말하다''라는 뜻입니다. 보통 Stop beating around the bush(돌려 말하지 마) 형태로 많이 쓰여요.','Well, it''s kind of complicated, you see...','음, 그게 좀 복잡한데...','Stop beating around the bush and tell me.','빙빙 돌리지 말고 그냥 말해.',ARRAY['Stop','beating','around','the','bush','and','tell','me']::varchar[],ARRAY['Stop','bushes','and','beating','beat','the','tell','me','around','bush','tells']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "He beat around the bush for ten minutes before asking for money.", "highlightingPart": "beat around the bush", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 10분을 빙빙 돌리다가 돈 얘기를 꺼내더라.", "practiceQuestion": "What did he want to talk about?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 무슨 얘기 하고 싶어 했던 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/275/practice-examples/ff7cf311-9c59-4058-8f79-dd556a4ef500.webp", "sentenceWords": ["He", "beat", "around", "the", "bush", "for", "ten", "minutes", "before", "asking", "for", "money"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["beats", "for", "for", "the", "minute", "asking", "asked", "beat", "ten", "minutes", "before", "bush", "money", "around", "He"]}, {"sentenceText": "I won''t beat around the bush — you didn''t get the part.", "highlightingPart": "beat around the bush", "sentenceTranslation": "돌려 말하지 않을게. 너 그 배역 안 됐어.", "practiceQuestion": "Just tell me how the audition results came out.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "오디션 결과 어떻게 나왔는지 그냥 말해줘.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/275/practice-examples/658637ba-82dd-4115-8690-818efd9ee0b5.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "won''t", "beat", "around", "the", "bush", "you", "didn''t", "get", "the", "part"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["the", "I", "you", "the", "won''t", "part", "beat", "gets", "beats", "bush", "around", "get", "bushes", "didn''t"]}, {"sentenceText": "She always beats around the bush when it''s 