(277,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',114,'get cold feet','막판에 겁먹고 망설이다','막판에 겁먹는 get cold feet','''발이 차가워지다'', 즉 ''막판에 겁이 나서 망설이다''라는 뜻입니다. 결혼, 발표, 고백처럼 큰일을 앞두고 갑자기 자신이 없어질 때 쓰는 표현이에요.','How was the presentation?','발표 어땠어?','I got cold feet right before the presentation.','발표 직전에 갑자기 겁이 났어.',ARRAY['I','got','cold','feet','right','before','the','presentation']::varchar[],ARRAY['cold','get','feet','foot','the','presentation','right','I','got','before','presentations']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "He got cold feet and canceled the interview.", "highlightingPart": "got cold feet", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 겁먹고 면접을 취소했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did he show up for the interview?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 면접 보러 갔대?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/277/practice-examples/f5c60c24-5f59-4651-bb45-b66238300eac.webp", "sentenceWords": ["He", "got", "cold", "feet", "and", "canceled", "the", "interview"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["foot", "interview", "cold", "gets", "canceled", "and", "got", "feet", "He", "the", "cancels"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s normal to get cold feet before a big decision.", "highlightingPart": "get cold feet", "sentenceTranslation": "큰 결정 앞에서 망설여지는 건 당연해.", "practiceQuestion": "I keep hesitating about signing the contract.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "계약서에 사인하는 게 자꾸 망설여져.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/277/practice-examples/bbaa351d-7ff8-422d-aab8-5d4c73251e83.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "normal", "to", "get", "cold", "feet", "before", "a", "big", "decision"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["a", "big", "normally", "It''s", "foot", "feet", "get", "normal", "decision", "gets", "cold", "to", "before"]}, {"sentenceText": "She almost got cold feet on her wedding day.", "highlightingPart": "got cold feet", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 결혼식 날 하마터면 마음이 흔들릴 뻔했대.", "practiceQuestion": "Did the wedding go smoothly?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "결혼식은 잘 