(282,NULL,'TIME_PLANNING','BASIC','EN','KR',119,'down the road','나중에, 장래에','나중 일을 말하는 down the road','''길을 따라 내려가면'', 즉 ''나중에, 장래에''라는 뜻입니다. later보다 훨씬 원어민스러운 시간 표현으로, a few years down the road처럼 기간과 함께 쓰기도 해요.','Can we discuss this now?','이거 지금 얘기할 수 있어?','We can talk about that down the road.','그건 나중에 얘기해도 돼.',ARRAY['We','can','talk','about','that','down','the','road']::varchar[],ARRAY['talk','talks','roads','that','street','the','We','can','down','road','about']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Buying now will save you money down the road.", "highlightingPart": "down the road", "sentenceTranslation": "지금 사두면 나중에 돈 아끼는 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "I''m not sure it''s worth paying full price for this now.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "지금 이걸 제값 주고 사는 게 맞나 모르겠어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/282/practice-examples/e6688132-b87c-404b-be7f-e5d1c0533634.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Buying", "now", "will", "save", "you", "money", "down", "the", "road"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["road", "money", "save", "down", "saves", "Buying", "buy", "roads", "the", "will", "now", "you"]}, {"sentenceText": "A few years down the road, you''ll thank yourself.", "highlightingPart": "down the road", "sentenceTranslation": "몇 년 지나면 스스로에게 고마워할 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Saving money like this feels pointless sometimes.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이렇게 돈 모으는 게 가끔 무의미하게 느껴져.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/282/practice-examples/f7414a97-103d-44d3-a9fa-3e5139a75140.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "few", "years", "down", "the", "road", "you''ll", "thank", "yourself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["you''ll", "road", "thanks", "down", "the", "thank", "year", "few", "years", "yourself", "A", "roads"]}, {"sentenceText": "We might expand down the road.", "highlightingPart": "down the road", "sentenceTranslation": "나중에 확장할 수도 있어.", "practiceQuestion": "Is the store going to stay this size?", "practiceQuestionTranslation"