(307,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','SLANG_NEOLOGISM','EN','KR',144,'You ate!','완전 잘했다, 찢었다','찢었다고 칭찬하는 You ate!','''너 찢었다!'', ''완전 해냈다!''라는 뜻의 최신 슬랭입니다. 무대, 패션, 결과물이 압도적으로 훌륭할 때 쓰며, ate that, ate and left no crumbs 같은 변형도 있어요.','How was the concert last night?','어젯밤 콘서트 어땠어?','Did you see her performance? She ate!','걔 무대 봤어? 완전 찢었어!',ARRAY['Did','you','see','her','performance','She','ate']::varchar[],ARRAY['performance','saw','her','performances','ate','Did','you','eight','She','see']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "You ate with that outfit.", "highlightingPart": "You ate", "sentenceTranslation": "그 옷 완전 찢었다.", "practiceQuestion": "How do I look in this?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 이거 입으니까 어때?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/307/practice-examples/ec324d4b-a94b-4287-8ee4-106bc8d2da15.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You", "ate", "with", "that", "outfit"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["this", "ate", "with", "that", "eight", "You", "outfit", "outfits"]}, {"sentenceText": "Honestly, you ate that presentation.", "highlightingPart": "you ate", "sentenceTranslation": "솔직히 너 그 발표 씹어먹었어.", "practiceQuestion": "I was so nervous up there. How did I do?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 앞에서 얼마나 떨렸는지 몰라. 나 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/307/practice-examples/700a4911-8014-4fb4-adf4-ce42afe6025d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Honestly", "you", "ate", "that", "presentation"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["presentations", "Honest", "presentation", "ate", "eight", "you", "that", "Honestly"]}, {"sentenceText": "She ate and left no crumbs.", "highlightingPart": "ate and left no crumbs", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 완벽하게 찢었어, 흠잡을 데가 없어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did she do well on stage?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 무대에서 잘했어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/307/practice-examples/3a8e6686-4db4-4bdb-9536-9a6a5b1f7c6a.webp", "sentenceWords": ["She", "ate", "and", "left", "