(336,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',173,'I was going to say','나도 그 말 하려던 참이었어','맞장구로 얹는 I was going to say','상대가 내가 하려던 말을 먼저 꺼냈을 때 ''안 그래도 그 말 하려고 했어''라고 맞장구치는 표현입니다. 뒤에 하려던 말을 이어 붙여서 쓸 수도 있어요.','This soup tastes a bit bland, right?','이 국 좀 싱겁지 않아?','I know, I was going to say that.','그니까, 나도 그 말 하려고 했어.',ARRAY['I','know','I','was','going','to','say','that']::varchar[],ARRAY['to','knows','I','know','were','was','saying','say','going','I','that']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I was going to say that!", "highlightingPart": "I was going to say", "sentenceTranslation": "나도 그 말 하려고 했어!", "practiceQuestion": "Doesn''t he look just like his dad?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 아빠랑 완전 붕어빵이지 않냐?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/336/practice-examples/cbf4d3d3-17e0-4e85-9265-51d72ff2813c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "was", "going", "to", "say", "that"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["say", "to", "I", "was", "going", "that", "am", "saying", "were"]}, {"sentenceText": "I was going to say the same thing.", "highlightingPart": "I was going to say", "sentenceTranslation": "안 그래도 같은 생각 하고 있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Maybe we should take a break.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "우리 좀 쉬는 게 좋겠어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/336/practice-examples/f12c9a65-e794-4a56-addc-43838e234ae0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "was", "going", "to", "say", "the", "same", "thing"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["to", "going", "same", "the", "am", "thing", "were", "I", "say", "was", "saying"]}, {"sentenceText": "I was going to say we should use it.", "highlightingPart": "I was going to say", "sentenceTranslation": "안 그래도 이거 쓰자고 말하려던 참이었어.", "practiceQuestion": "This song would be perfect for the video.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이 노래 영상에 딱이겠다.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/336/practice-examples/dfd8c4d3-7b99-430d-8c2a-2f2fbccc08ae.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I"