(347,NULL,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',184,'wouldn''t hurt','~해서 나쁠 건 없다','나쁠 건 없다고 돌려 말하는 wouldn''t hurt','''~해서 나쁠 건 없다''라는 우리말과 거의 똑같이 쓰이는 표현입니다. 해 보라고 직접 밀어붙이는 대신 부담 없이 권하는, 영어 특유의 돌려 말하기예요.','Do you think they''d give us a discount?','걔네가 할인해 줄까?','It wouldn''t hurt to ask.','물어봐서 나쁠 건 없잖아.',ARRAY['It','wouldn''t','hurt','to','ask']::varchar[],ARRAY['hurts','hurt','ask','It','to','wouldn''t','asking']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "It wouldn''t hurt to bring one.", "highlightingPart": "wouldn''t hurt", "sentenceTranslation": "챙겨서 나쁠 건 없지.", "practiceQuestion": "Should I bring an umbrella? The sky looks fine.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "우산 챙길까? 하늘은 멀쩡한데.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/347/practice-examples/e375cb7c-c28f-4ac2-ad0f-a28e647ca227.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It", "wouldn''t", "hurt", "to", "bring", "one"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["wouldn''t", "to", "bringing", "hurt", "It", "one", "hurts", "bring"]}, {"sentenceText": "One more review wouldn''t hurt.", "highlightingPart": "wouldn''t hurt", "sentenceTranslation": "한 번 더 본다고 나쁠 건 없어.", "practiceQuestion": "I already studied everything.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "공부할 건 다 했어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/347/practice-examples/b1ef7072-5392-45d8-9f89-7949ce6384ac.webp", "sentenceWords": ["One", "more", "review", "wouldn''t", "hurt"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["hurt", "One", "review", "reviews", "more", "hurts", "wouldn''t"]}, {"sentenceText": "It wouldn''t hurt to see a doctor anyway.", "highlightingPart": "wouldn''t hurt", "sentenceTranslation": "그래도 병원 한번 가서 나쁠 건 없어.", "practiceQuestion": "My knee feels mostly fine now.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "무릎 이제 거의 괜찮은데.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/347/practice-examples/1a7a9659-2a3d-4b78-89c7-7b525b1c01b8.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It", "wouldn''t", "hurt", "to", "see", "a", "doctor", "anyway"], "sentenceW