(349,NULL,'TIME_PLANNING','BASIC','EN','KR',186,'haven''t + p.p. + in a while','오랫동안 ~ 안 했다, 오랜만이다','''오랜만에''를 표현하는 haven''t p.p. + in a while','놀랍게도 영어에는 ''오랜만에''에 딱 들어맞는 단어가 없습니다. 그래서 ''오랫동안 ~하지 못했다''라는 현재완료 부정으로 그 느낌을 표현해요. 뭔가를 제안하는 이유로도 자주 붙입니다.','What are you in the mood for tonight?','오늘 저녁 뭐 당겨?','Let''s get sushi. We haven''t had it in a while.','초밥 먹자. 오랜만이잖아.',ARRAY['Let''s','get','sushi','We','haven''t','had','it','in','a','while']::varchar[],ARRAY['sushi','in','it','a','had','got','while','haven''t','since','has','We','Let''s','get']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I haven''t played in a while.", "highlightingPart": "haven''t played in a while", "sentenceTranslation": "친 지 꽤 됐어.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you still play tennis?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "테니스 아직 쳐?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/349/practice-examples/9f5120cf-ac42-4e07-bafb-ac40e1217865.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "haven''t", "played", "in", "a", "while"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["in", "hasn''t", "a", "since", "play", "haven''t", "I", "while", "played"]}, {"sentenceText": "You''re right, I haven''t called her in a while.", "highlightingPart": "haven''t called her in a while", "sentenceTranslation": "맞아, 연락 못 드린 지 오래됐네.", "practiceQuestion": "Call your grandma sometime.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "할머니한테 가끔 전화 좀 드려.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/349/practice-examples/f385f670-2840-497d-850f-1f9c0c677e9b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You''re", "right", "I", "haven''t", "called", "her", "in", "a", "while"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I", "called", "haven''t", "since", "call", "in", "right", "while", "her", "hasn''t", "a", "You''re"]}, {"sentenceText": "I haven''t worked out in a while.", "highlightingPart": "haven''t worked out in a while", "sentenceTranslation": "운동 안 한 지 좀 됐거든.", "practiceQuestion": "Why are you so out of breath?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "왜 이렇게 숨을 헐떡여?", "imageUrl": "htt