(350,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',187,'couldn''t care less','전혀 신경 안 쓴다','1도 신경 안 쓴다는 couldn''t care less','지금도 신경 쓰는 정도가 바닥이라 ''이보다 덜 신경 쓸 수가 없다'', 즉 ''전혀 신경 안 쓴다''는 표현입니다. 관심 없다는 걸 시원하게 못 박을 때 써요.','People might talk if you show up in that outfit.','그 옷 입고 가면 사람들이 수군댈걸.','I couldn''t care less what they think.','걔네가 어떻게 생각하든 전혀 신경 안 써.',ARRAY['I','couldn''t','care','less','what','they','think']::varchar[],ARRAY['think','cares','less','thinks','couldn''t','they','care','fewer','what','I']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I couldn''t care less.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t care less", "sentenceTranslation": "알 바 아니야.", "practiceQuestion": "The neighbors complained about your garden gnomes.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이웃들이 네 정원 장식 갖고 뭐라 하던데.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/350/practice-examples/5ea3f0e7-8121-44fb-8310-7f6d6ee84173.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "couldn''t", "care", "less"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["couldn''t", "can''t", "I", "less", "least", "cares", "care"]}, {"sentenceText": "Honestly, I couldn''t care less about rankings.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t care less", "sentenceTranslation": "솔직히 순위엔 전혀 관심 없어.", "practiceQuestion": "Aren''t you worried about the rankings?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "순위 신경 안 쓰여?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/350/practice-examples/d33aa56f-d4cc-49ef-abf9-678279074cf6.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Honestly", "I", "couldn''t", "care", "less", "about", "rankings"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["cares", "Honestly", "I", "rankings", "care", "less", "couldn''t", "of", "about", "least"]}, {"sentenceText": "I couldn''t care less what he says.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t care less", "sentenceTranslation": "걔가 뭐라 하든 알 바 아니야.", "practiceQuestion": "He said your car is outdated.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔가 네 차 구식이라던데.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/350/practice-examples/8