(354,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',191,'go ahead','먼저 해, 그렇게 해','먼저 하라고 양보하는 go ahead','go ahead는 상대에게 허락하거나 순서를 양보할 때 쓰는 한마디다. "먼저 해", "그렇게 해"라는 뜻으로, 질문에 대한 승낙부터 문 앞이나 엘리베이터에서의 양보까지 두루 쓰인다.','Do you mind if I take the last slice?','마지막 조각 내가 먹어도 돼?','Go ahead, I''m full anyway.','먹어, 어차피 나 배불러.',ARRAY['Go','ahead','I''m','full','anyway']::varchar[],ARRAY['forward','Goes','fully','full','I''m','anyway','Go','ahead']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Sure, go ahead.", "highlightingPart": "go ahead", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 물어봐.", "practiceQuestion": "Can I ask you something kind of personal?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "좀 사적인 거 물어봐도 돼?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/354/practice-examples/57dbab9b-b6e6-4bcd-9b79-03ae40f50700.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sure", "go", "ahead"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["go", "ahead", "goes", "Sure", "forward"]}, {"sentenceText": "You go ahead, I''ll take the next one.", "highlightingPart": "go ahead", "sentenceTranslation": "먼저 타세요, 저는 다음 거 탈게요.", "practiceQuestion": "The elevator''s pretty full. Are you getting in?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "엘리베이터가 꽉 찼네요. 타실 거예요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/354/practice-examples/684ae432-0a3a-44ae-b800-378ada472a2f.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You", "go", "ahead", "I''ll", "take", "the", "next", "one"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["You", "the", "go", "I''ll", "take", "forward", "ahead", "one", "takes", "goes", "next"]}, {"sentenceText": "She said to go ahead without her.", "highlightingPart": "go ahead", "sentenceTranslation": "걔가 자기 빼고 먼저 시키래.", "practiceQuestion": "Should we wait for Chloe before ordering?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "클로이 올 때까지 기다렸다가 주문할까?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/354/practice-examples/596a172a-9754-46b4-93db-18ecff491fda.webp", "sentenceWords": ["She", "said", "to", "go", "ahead", "without", "her"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["t