(357,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',194,'put up with','참고 견디다','꾹 참을 때 put up with','put up with는 싫은 사람이나 상황을 불평 없이 견딜 때 쓴다. tolerate보다 훨씬 구어적이고, can''t put up with ~ anymore(더는 못 참겠다) 형태로 폭발 직전의 심정을 표현하기도 한다.','How''s living with your new roommate?','새 룸메랑 사는 건 어때?','I''m putting up with his snoring somehow.','걔 코골이를 어떻게든 참고 있어.',ARRAY['I''m','putting','up','with','his','snoring','somehow']::varchar[],ARRAY['somehow','putting','his','I''m','on','put','with','snoring','somewhat','up']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I couldn''t put up with the manager anymore.", "highlightingPart": "put up with", "sentenceTranslation": "매니저를 더는 못 참겠더라고.", "practiceQuestion": "Why did you finally quit that part-time job?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 알바 왜 결국 그만뒀어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/357/practice-examples/1b6de93f-d7b0-4612-8426-8aae8bf50b1d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "couldn''t", "put", "up", "with", "the", "manager", "anymore"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["manager", "put", "putting", "couldn''t", "up", "managers", "I", "on", "anymore", "with", "the"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''ve put up with it for a month now.", "highlightingPart": "put up with", "sentenceTranslation": "벌써 한 달째 참는 중이야.", "practiceQuestion": "Isn''t the construction noise driving you crazy?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "공사 소음 때문에 미치겠지 않아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/357/practice-examples/90629c09-3f38-4564-8770-c023f45d2ec6.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''ve", "put", "up", "with", "it", "for", "a", "month", "now"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["up", "it", "with", "for", "month", "putting", "a", "I''ve", "months", "since", "put", "now"]}, {"sentenceText": "She''s used to putting up with their noise.", "highlightingPart": "putting up with", "sentenceTranslation": "걔는 걔네 소란 참는 게 익숙하거든.", "practiceQuestion": "How does Chloe stay so calm with her little brothers?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "클로이는 남