(358,NULL,'WORK_STUDY','BASIC','EN','KR',195,'look up','(정보를) 찾아보다','검색할 때 쓰는 look up','look up은 사전이나 인터넷에서 정보를 찾아볼 때 쓰는 기본 구동사다. look it up처럼 대명사 목적어는 반드시 look과 up 사이에 넣는다는 점만 기억하면 되고, 사람 이름을 검색할 때도 쓴다.','What does this word on the menu mean?','메뉴판에 있는 이 단어 무슨 뜻이야?','No clue, let me look it up.','몰라, 내가 찾아볼게.',ARRAY['No','clue','let','me','look','it','up']::varchar[],ARRAY['looks','up','look','my','let','me','clue','it','at','No']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Hold on, I''ll look it up.", "highlightingPart": "look it up", "sentenceTranslation": "잠깐만, 찾아볼게.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you know when the library closes today?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "오늘 도서관 몇 시에 닫는지 알아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/358/practice-examples/bd785350-d7c0-40f7-b06e-18742f45ea38.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Hold", "on", "I''ll", "look", "it", "up"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["on", "I''ll", "up", "its", "look", "looks", "Hold", "it", "Held"]}, {"sentenceText": "I look up anything I''m not sure about.", "highlightingPart": "look up", "sentenceTranslation": "헷갈리는 건 전부 찾아봐.", "practiceQuestion": "How did you memorize all these grammar rules?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이 문법 규칙들을 다 어떻게 외웠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/358/practice-examples/765874b2-2e51-4f40-8db9-1f608973c9af.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "look", "up", "anything", "I''m", "not", "sure", "about"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["sure", "up", "about", "anything", "I''m", "look", "not", "I", "looks", "surely"]}, {"sentenceText": "I looked him up, and yeah, it''s true.", "highlightingPart": "looked him up", "sentenceTranslation": "내가 찾아봤는데, 응, 진짜더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Was that actor really in that old drama?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 배우가 진짜 그 옛날 드라마에 나왔어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/358/practice-examples/e9edad9f-3d1d-4358-97c6-44263009a8a2.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "looked", 