(366,NULL,'WORK_STUDY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',203,'be swamped','(일이) 산더미다','일에 파묻혔을 때 be swamped','swamp(늪)에 빠진 것처럼 일에 파묻혀 허우적댄다는 이미지의 표현이다. "I''m swamped with work/assignments"처럼 with 뒤에 바쁜 이유를 붙이며, 약속을 미루거나 부탁을 거절할 때 이유로 대기 좋다.','Wanna grab dinner tonight?','오늘 저녁 같이 먹을래?','I can''t. I''m swamped with assignments.','안 돼. 과제가 산더미야.',ARRAY['I','can''t','I''m','swamped','with','assignments']::varchar[],ARRAY['with','can''t','swamp','I','of','I''m','swamped','assignments','assignment']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Midterms are coming. I''m so swamped.", "highlightingPart": "swamped", "sentenceTranslation": "중간고사 다가오잖아. 할 게 산더미야.", "practiceQuestion": "You look exhausted these days.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 요즘 완전 지쳐 보여.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/366/practice-examples/59e142a6-8d0c-4ecb-921c-075936ec1b41.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Midterms", "are", "coming", "I''m", "so", "swamped"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I''m", "swamp", "so", "are", "coming", "come", "swamped", "Midterms", "is"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sorry, I''m swamped this week.", "highlightingPart": "I''m swamped", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 이번 주는 일이 꽉 찼어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Could you take on one more project?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "프로젝트 하나만 더 맡아줄 수 있어요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/366/practice-examples/4fcaaa91-e796-4f85-ae95-5914ad6639cd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I''m", "swamped", "this", "week"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["weeks", "swamped", "week", "I''m", "swamp", "Sorry", "this"]}, {"sentenceText": "She''s swamped with her part-time job.", "highlightingPart": "She''s swamped", "sentenceTranslation": "걔 알바 때문에 정신없이 바빠.", "practiceQuestion": "Why didn''t Chloe come to the club meeting?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "클로이는 왜 동아리 모임 안 왔어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/366/practice-examples/36052332-9da1-4623-8e9a-1beaff831fc4.webp",