(403,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','SLANG_NEOLOGISM','EN','KR',240,'I was today years old','오늘에서야 처음 알았다','뒤늦은 깨달음 I was today years old','"내 나이가 ''오늘 살''이 되어서야 알았다"는 말장난으로, 진작 알았어야 할 걸 뒤늦게 깨달았을 때 스스로를 놀리며 쓰는 유머 표현이다. 보통 I was today years old when I learned/found out ~ 패턴으로 쓴다. 밈에서 온 슬랭이라 격식 자리나 윗사람에게는 부적합하다.','Did you know the library opens at seven?','도서관 7시에 여는 거 알았어?','I was today years old when I found that out.','나 그거 오늘에서야 처음 알았어.',ARRAY['I','was','today','years','old','when','I','found','that','out']::varchar[],ARRAY['out','years','I','were','old','found','find','when','year','that','was','I','today']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I was today years old when I learned the cafeteria does free refills.", "highlightingPart": "I was today years old", "sentenceTranslation": "학식 리필 되는 거 오늘 처음 알았거든.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you look so shocked?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "왜 그렇게 놀란 표정이야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/403/practice-examples/8e502fa2-91c1-48ca-8f4f-24aef1a7247b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "was", "today", "years", "old", "when", "I", "learned", "the", "cafeteria", "does", "free", "refills"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["learned", "when", "was", "does", "do", "years", "year", "free", "I", "cafeteria", "learn", "today", "the", "old", "I", "refills"]}, {"sentenceText": "Nope, I was today years old.", "highlightingPart": "I was today years old", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 오늘에서야 알았다니까.", "practiceQuestion": "You seriously didn''t know they were siblings?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔네 남매인 거 진짜 몰랐어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/403/practice-examples/87e0d298-5a98-4a3f-889f-d17c7103d7df.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Nope", "I", "was", "today", "years", "old"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["years", "were", "year", "Nope", "today", "old", "I", "was", "yesterday"]}, {"sentenceText": "I was today years old when I finally read the syllabus.", "highlightingPart": "I was tod