(432,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',269,'moral of the story','결론은, 이 얘기의 교훈은','이야기의 교훈 moral of the story','원래 우화 끝에 붙는 "이 이야기의 교훈"이라는 말인데, 일상에서는 자기 경험담을 마무리하며 결론을 한 줄로 뽑을 때 쓴다. 진지한 교훈뿐 아니라 "결론: 다신 안 감"처럼 웃긴 결론을 붙이는 반농담 용법도 흔하다. 이야기 끝맺음 신호라 듣는 사람도 정리 타이밍임을 안다.','So what did you learn from that whole mess?','그래서 그 난리 겪고 뭘 배웠는데?','Moral of the story: always back up your files.','결론은, 파일은 무조건 백업해라.',ARRAY['Moral','of','the','story','always','back','up','your','files']::varchar[],ARRAY['files','your','the','file','Morale','back','always','Moral','stories','story','up','of']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Way too much. Moral of the story, nothing is ever free.", "highlightingPart": "Moral of the story", "sentenceTranslation": "너무 많이. 교훈은, 세상에 공짜는 없다는 거지.", "practiceQuestion": "So the \"free\" trip cost you how much?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그래서 그 ''공짜'' 여행에 얼마 쓴 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/432/practice-examples/149b4799-84eb-4eaa-a099-2007a5de0046.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Way", "too", "much", "Moral", "of", "the", "story", "nothing", "is", "ever", "free"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["much", "nothing", "free", "of", "Way", "story", "the", "is", "Morale", "Moral", "too", "are", "to", "ever"]}, {"sentenceText": "Barely. Moral of the story: start before the deadline week.", "highlightingPart": "Moral of the story", "sentenceTranslation": "겨우. 결론은, 마감 주 전에 시작하자는 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you finish the essay after pulling an all-nighter?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "밤새고 나서 에세이는 다 썼어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/432/practice-examples/f246f591-ffc1-4e98-9391-2517aa9e7524.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Barely", "Moral", "of", "the", "story", "start", "before", "the", "deadline", "week"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["week", "the", "weeks", "Moral", "of", "the", "Morale", "before", "deadline", "story", "started", "start", "Barely"]}, {"sentenceText": "One terrible haircut. That''s the moral of the story.", "highlightingPart": "moral of the story", "sentenceTranslation": "끔찍한 머리 한 번이면 충분하지. 그게 이 얘기의 교훈이야.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you always check reviews now?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "넌 왜 요즘 꼭 리뷰부터 확인해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/432/practice-examples/fdf9566a-2ce0-4c93-957a-710cc70cb81c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["One", "terrible", "haircut", "That''s", "the", "moral", "of", "the", "story"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["That''s", "the", "moral", "One", "the", "haircut", "morale", "story", "of", "haircuts", "terrible", "terribly"]}, {"sentenceText": "Never. Moral of the story, don''t mix friends and money.", "highlightingPart": "Moral of the story", "sentenceTranslation": "절대. 교훈은, 친구랑 돈은 섞지 말자는 거.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you lend him money again?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔한테 또 돈 빌려줄 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/432/practice-examples/e64533ec-be40-45d4-adfe-1b7af68d78be.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Never", "Moral", "of", "the", "story", "don''t", "mix", "friends", "and", "money"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["money", "friends", "Moral", "the", "Never", "Morale", "mix", "friend", "of", "mixes", "don''t", "and", "story"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0296936035,-0.0119552612,-0.0700073242,-0.00399398804,0.00687789917,0.000959396362,-0.020690918,0.0236206055,0.00693893433,-0.0198974609,0.0337219238,-0.0277862549,-0.0260925293,-0.0321655273,0.0253601074,-0.032409668,-0.0284423828,-0.00743484497,0.0173034668,0.011932373,0.0090637207,-0.00222587585,0.0372619629,0.0550842285,-0.0193786621,0.0432739258,-0.000663280487,0.0277709961,0.0312805176,0.0113601685,0.00235748291,-0.0228118896,0.010887146,-0.0560302734,0.0215606689,0.0632324219,0.0637817383,-0.0601501465,0.052520752,-0.0344543457,-0.0280761719,-0.0414733887,-0.0120010376,-0.0126800537,0.0220336914,-0.00796508789,0.0106201172,-0.0236053467,0.010