(514,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',351,'food for thought','생각할 거리, 곱씹을 만한 화두','생각할 거리 food for thought','바로 결론을 내리기보다 두고두고 곱씹어볼 만한 얘기나 화두를 가리키는 표현이다. 직역하면 "생각을 위한 음식"인데, 머리가 소화할 거리를 준다는 그림에서 나왔다. 격식·캐주얼 어디서나 무난하게 쓰이고, That''s food for thought처럼 상대 말에 대한 반응으로도 자주 나온다.','What did you think of the professor''s lecture today?','오늘 교수님 강의 어땠어?','It really gave me some food for thought.','진짜 생각할 거리를 많이 던져주더라.',ARRAY['It','really','gave','me','some','food','for','thought']::varchar[],ARRAY['for','really','thoughts','foods','It','me','thought','give','gave','food','some']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Yeah, it was real food for thought.", "highlightingPart": "food for thought", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 진짜 곱씹어볼 만한 내용이더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you read the article I sent you?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "내가 보낸 기사 읽어봤어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/514/practice-examples/0ef74942-17b2-48fc-8187-bfb77406ef52.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yeah", "it", "was", "real", "food", "for", "thought"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["foods", "real", "thought", "were", "for", "it", "food", "Yeah", "was", "thoughts"]}, {"sentenceText": "Interesting. That''s definitely food for thought.", "highlightingPart": "food for thought", "sentenceTranslation": "흥미로운데. 확실히 생각해볼 만한 얘기다.", "practiceQuestion": "What do you think of my plan to take a gap year?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나 일 년 휴학하려는 계획 어떻게 생각해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/514/practice-examples/7cce22e3-04c7-4c4c-aa2e-d59be1aae734.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Interesting", "That''s", "definitely", "food", "for", "thought"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["thought", "definite", "That''s", "definitely", "for", "foods", "Interesting", "thoughts", "food"]}, {"sentenceText": "It gave me a lot of food for thought about money.", "highlightingPart": "food for thought", "sentenceTranslation": "돈에 대해 생각할 거리를 엄청 던져주더라.", "practiceQuestion": 