(590,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',427,'blow off steam','스트레스를 풀다','스트레스 발산 blow off steam','쌓인 스트레스나 화를 운동, 수다, 놀이 같은 걸로 발산해서 푼다는 표현이다. 증기기관이 압력을 빼려고 증기를 내뿜는 그림에서 왔다. 약속을 바람맞힌다는 blow off와 표면이 비슷하지만 완전히 다른 뜻이니 헷갈리지 말자.','Want to hit the gym after the exam?','시험 끝나고 헬스장 갈래?','Yeah, I need to blow off some steam.','좋아, 나 스트레스 좀 풀어야 돼.',ARRAY['Yeah','I','need','to','blow','off','some','steam']::varchar[],ARRAY['steam','blew','I','need','needs','Yeah','to','some','blow','off','steams']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I go running at night to blow off steam.", "highlightingPart": "blow off steam", "sentenceTranslation": "밤에 달리기하면서 스트레스 풀어.", "practiceQuestion": "How do you deal with finals stress?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "기말 스트레스 어떻게 풀어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/590/practice-examples/a5228d4e-490b-4df8-a182-cb1573e95748.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "go", "running", "at", "night", "to", "blow", "off", "steam"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["blow", "I", "go", "running", "steam", "at", "off", "blew", "goes", "night", "to", "ran"]}, {"sentenceText": "Rough day. He''s just blowing off steam.", "highlightingPart": "blowing off steam", "sentenceTranslation": "힘든 하루였대. 그냥 화 좀 발산하는 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Why is he punching the pillow?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 왜 베개를 때리고 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/590/practice-examples/d148b33d-061c-4704-94ce-c86f4c6276ac.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Rough", "day", "He''s", "just", "blowing", "off", "steam"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Rough", "off", "just", "steams", "blows", "day", "days", "blowing", "steam", "He''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "Definitely. We all need to blow off steam.", "highlightingPart": "blow off steam", "sentenceTranslation": "당연하지. 우리 다 스트레스 풀어야 돼.", "practiceQuestion": "Should we do noraebang this weekend?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이번 주말에 노래방 갈까?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/590/practice-examples/0155c4cf-4bae-488c-8d8d-c2fbec010487.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Definitely", "We", "all", "need", "to", "blow", "off", "steam"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["blow", "off", "all", "blew", "to", "steams", "We", "Definitely", "steam", "needs", "need"]}, {"sentenceText": "A bit, but people blew off steam and moved on.", "highlightingPart": "blew off steam", "sentenceTranslation": "좀 그랬는데, 다들 털어내고 넘어갔어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did the team meeting get heated?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "팀 회의 험악해졌어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/590/practice-examples/f9bc6f8d-229d-4437-9cee-ffea01001b7e.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "bit", "but", "people", "blew", "off", "steam", "and", "moved", "on"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["steam", "A", "steams", "and", "on", "but", "people", "bit", "blow", "blew", "off", "moved", "moves"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0433349609,0.0330810547,-0.0479431152,-0.0169830322,-0.053314209,-0.00802612305,-0.0307006836,0.00525665283,0.0322875977,-0.0120391846,0.0612487793,0.0176239014,-0.025100708,0.00618362427,0.0258026123,-0.013885498,-0.0260467529,0.0396728516,-0.0213012695,0.0307006836,0.00807952881,-0.0288391113,-0.00173950195,0.0438842773,0.02003479,0.0731811523,-0.0113754272,-0.0229034424,0.0101318359,0.00921630859,0.0238342285,-0.037689209,0.052154541,-0.048614502,0.0541687012,0.0194702148,-0.0105743408,-0.0563659668,0.0226593018,-0.0181274414,-0.00462722778,-0.0553283691,-0.0343933105,0.0164642334,0.0207061768,0.0584716797,0.0126647949,-0.00335121155,0.0218963623,0.024230957,0.00373268127,-0.00275611877,0.0404052734,0.01953125,0.019744873,-0.0319519043,0.00894927979,0.0115890503,-0.00520706177,-0.00909423828,0.033203125,-0.00954437256,0.0371398926,0.0601806641,-0.0188751221,-0.000590801239,0.0515441895,0.0231628418,-0.0119857788,0.0171508789,-0.0104293823,-0.00369644165,-0.0448608398,0.035949707,0.0187072754,-0.0293579102,0.00133132935,0.