(633,NULL,'TRAVEL_MOVEMENT','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',470,'off the beaten path','관광객이 잘 안 가는, 덜 알려진 곳','숨은 여행길 off the beaten path','많은 사람이 밟아 다져진(beaten) 길에서 벗어난 곳, 즉 유명 관광 코스 밖의 덜 알려진 장소를 뜻하는 고전 관용구다. off the beaten track이라고도 하며, 장소뿐 아니라 남들과 다른 선택을 비유할 때도 쓴다. 여행 취향을 말할 때 격조 있게 들리는 표현이다.','Are you doing the usual tourist spots in Kyoto?','교토에서 뻔한 관광지 코스 돌 거야?','No, I want to go off the beaten path this time.','아니, 이번엔 사람들 잘 모르는 데로 가보려고.',ARRAY['No','I','want','to','go','off','the','beaten','path','this','time']::varchar[],ARRAY['I','the','off','this','path','go','of','to','want','paths','No','beaten','beat','time']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "A local told me. It''s way off the beaten path.", "highlightingPart": "off the beaten path", "sentenceTranslation": "현지인이 알려줬어. 완전 알려지지 않은 곳이야.", "practiceQuestion": "How did you find that amazing little village?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 근사한 작은 마을은 어떻게 찾았어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/633/practice-examples/1621445d-38c9-414a-9228-eaf13f35c3d3.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "local", "told", "me", "It''s", "way", "off", "the", "beaten", "path"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["A", "me", "local", "the", "tell", "told", "beat", "path", "off", "of", "way", "beaten", "It''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s off the beaten path, so tourists skip it.", "highlightingPart": "off the beaten path", "sentenceTranslation": "관광 코스에서 벗어나 있어서 여행객들이 그냥 지나치거든.", "practiceQuestion": "Why was there no line at that temple?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 절엔 왜 줄이 없었대?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/633/practice-examples/241932e9-e5b0-4783-add5-1a0ca4eace21.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "off", "the", "beaten", "path", "so", "tourists", "skip", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["off", "it", "path", "so", "It''s", "the", "skips", "tourists", "of", "beat", "beaten", "skip"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, I leave room to wander off the beaten path.", "highlightingPart": "off the beaten path", "sentenceTranslation": "아니, 안 알려진 데로 샐 여지를 남겨 둬.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you plan every trip in detail?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "여행 갈 때 계획 다 짜고 가는 편이야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/633/practice-examples/9b15c52c-872c-44c9-8f67-c076bc83b432.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "I", "leave", "room", "to", "wander", "off", "the", "beaten", "path"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["No", "off", "of", "room", "the", "leave", "to", "path", "wonder", "beaten", "beat", "wander", "I"]}, {"sentenceText": "Maybe, but off the beaten path is where the stories are.", "highlightingPart": "off the beaten path", "sentenceTranslation": "그럴 수도, 근데 이야깃거리는 숨은 데서 나오더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Isn''t it risky to skip the famous spots?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "유명한 데를 건너뛰는 건 좀 아깝지 않아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/633/practice-examples/03c4e759-4507-4a7d-9665-5d22cc891834.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Maybe", "but", "off", "the", "beaten", "path", "is", "where", "the", "stories", "are"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["where", "are", "path", "is", "of", "stories", "off", "the", "Maybe", "beat", "beaten", "story", "but", "the"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0129013062,-0.0121765137,-0.034362793,0.00295448303,-0.0176696777,-0.0260314941,-0.0160369873,0.0101089478,0.0573425293,0.0286407471,-0.0330200195,0.010017395,0.0219268799,-0.00289154053,0.00936126709,0.00606536865,-0.0348815918,0.00312232971,0.0218048096,0.0333862305,0.0152282715,-0.00464630127,-0.0231018066,0.0192718506,-0.00690841675,0.0099029541,0.0082244873,0.00876617432,0.0230102539,-0.00111961365,0.0123138428,-0.0313415527,0.0463256836,-0.0454406738,0.0780029297,0.0309143066,0.0503540039,-0.0192871094,0.0219421387,-0.0387878418,0.0170440674,-0.0358276367,0.0282440186,-0.006980896,0.0510559082,0.0545349121,0.00886535645,0.0407409668,0.0166625977,-0.0249938965,0.00603485107,0.0338745117,-0.0182342529,0.0163269