(670,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',507,'talk a good game','말은 그럴듯하게 하다','말만 그럴듯 talk a good game','실력이나 실행은 검증되지 않았는데 말솜씨만 번지르르한 걸 묘사하는 표현이다. all talk과 비슷하지만, 말 자체는 설득력 있고 그럴듯하다는 점이 포인트다. He talks a good game, but...처럼 뒤에 반전을 붙여 쓰는 경우가 많다.','The new coach sounds really confident, right?','새 코치 진짜 자신만만해 보이지?','He talks a good game, but let''s see him win first.','말은 그럴듯한데, 일단 이기는 걸 봐야지.',ARRAY['He','talks','a','good','game','but','let''s','see','him','win','first']::varchar[],ARRAY['him','but','He','game','first','talks','let''s','wins','games','see','talk','win','a','good']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "No. They talked a good game but had no results.", "highlightingPart": "talked a good game", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요. 말은 번지르르한데 실적이 없더라고요.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you hire that marketing agency?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 마케팅 대행사랑 계약하셨어요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/670/practice-examples/61127166-ebb1-4979-817d-ff00d77d7abf.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "They", "talked", "a", "good", "game", "but", "had", "no", "results"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["has", "talks", "talked", "game", "No", "had", "no", "They", "but", "games", "results", "a", "good"]}, {"sentenceText": "He talks a good game. It''s always instant noodles.", "highlightingPart": "talks a good game", "sentenceTranslation": "말만 그럴듯해. 맨날 라면이야.", "practiceQuestion": "Your roommate says he can cook anything.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네 룸메 자기가 뭐든 요리할 수 있대.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/670/practice-examples/37680110-65da-4d4b-8cc2-cdcda1e2bc91.webp", "sentenceWords": ["He", "talks", "a", "good", "game", "It''s", "always", "instant", "noodles"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["always", "good", "He", "It''s", "game", "ever", "instant", "talks", "games", "noodles", "talk", "a"]}, {"sentenceText": "She doesn''t just talk a good game. She delivers.", "highlightingPart": "talk a good game",