(697,NULL,'RELATIONSHIP_SOCIAL','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',534,'come out of one''s shell','수줍음을 벗고 마음을 열다','껍질 깨고 나오기 come out of one''s shell','거북이가 껍질 밖으로 고개를 내밀듯, 낯을 가리던 사람이 수줍음을 벗고 적극적으로 어울리기 시작한다는 관용구다. 새 학기, 새 직장, 새 모임에서 서서히 마음을 여는 변화를 따뜻하게 묘사할 때 쓴다. 도와주는 쪽을 주어로 bring someone out of their shell 형태로도 쓴다.','Is that really the same quiet girl from freshman year?','쟤가 진짜 1학년 때 그 조용하던 애 맞아?','She''s really come out of her shell since joining the dance club.','걔 댄스 동아리 들어가고 나서 완전 껍질을 깨고 나왔어.',ARRAY['She''s','really','come','out','of','her','shell','since','joining','the','dance','club']::varchar[],ARRAY['her','off','of','really','out','club','shell','She''s','came','shells','joining','since','dance','come','the']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Better. He''s slowly coming out of his shell.", "highlightingPart": "coming out of his shell", "sentenceTranslation": "좋아졌어. 조금씩 낯가림을 벗고 있더라.", "practiceQuestion": "How''s your little brother doing at his new school?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네 동생은 새 학교에서 잘 지내?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/697/practice-examples/38279c28-523a-4c30-8d1c-dde53bbe3cf6.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Better", "He''s", "slowly", "coming", "out", "of", "his", "shell"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["off", "shell", "He''s", "Better", "comes", "slowly", "his", "shells", "coming", "of", "out"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m trying to help him come out of his shell.", "highlightingPart": "come out of his shell", "sentenceTranslation": "걔가 마음 열게 도와주려는 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you keep inviting the quiet intern to lunch?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 조용한 인턴을 왜 자꾸 점심에 데려가?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/697/practice-examples/f1c19490-aca9-40b8-ab58-760fd39e4432.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "trying", "to", "help", "him", "come", "out", "of", "his", "shell"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["help", "I''m", "him", "shell", "out", "off", "shells", "trying", "come", "his", "of", "to", "comes"]}, {"sentenceText": "No way. I only came out of my shell in college.", "highlightingPart": "came out of my shell", "sentenceTranslation": "전혀. 대학 와서야 껍질을 깨고 나왔지.", "practiceQuestion": "Were you always this outgoing?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 원래 이렇게 외향적이었어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/697/practice-examples/88c8b5f4-1641-4311-8d5d-7a8a26cb1ad0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "way", "I", "only", "came", "out", "of", "my", "shell", "in", "college"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["out", "No", "way", "in", "shells", "shell", "my", "I", "of", "came", "college", "off", "only", "comes"]}, {"sentenceText": "Game nights brought her out of her shell. She''s insanely competitive.", "highlightingPart": "out of her shell", "sentenceTranslation": "보드게임 밤이 걔 마음을 열게 했어. 승부욕이 장난 아니더라.", "practiceQuestion": "What finally brought your roommate out of her shell?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네 룸메는 뭐 때문에 마음을 열게 된 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/697/practice-examples/42c3a363-7da5-493b-9a08-1f96f6c3f78e.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Game", "nights", "brought", "her", "out", "of", "her", "shell", "She''s", "insanely", "competitive"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["her", "into", "She''s", "shell", "insanely", "out", "brought", "shells", "bring", "of", "her", "competitive", "nights", "Game"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0284423828,-0.0278015137,-0.0036315918,0.0710449219,0.0422363281,-0.013053894,0.00410461426,0.0322265625,0.0401000977,0.0503845215,-0.0174102783,-0.00232696533,0.0186767578,-0.0185699463,0.0179595947,-0.0137023926,-0.0112991333,0.00977325439,-0.0149307251,0.0242767334,0.0354309082,-0.0445556641,-0.0153427124,0.022354126,-0.00888061523,0.0247039795,-0.0137405396,0.0561828613,-0.00453186035,-0.0144424438,-0.0215301514,-0.0243225098,0.033416748,-0.031463623,0.0234527588,0.0279998779,-0.00668334961,-0.0240783691,-0.00240135193,0.000633716583,0.016998291,-0