(711,NULL,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',548,'It''s not you, it''s me','네 탓이 아니라 내 문제야','완곡한 거절 클리셰 It''s not you, it''s me','이별이나 거절을 부드럽게 포장할 때 쓰는 대표적인 클리셰다. "네가 문제가 아니라 내 문제야"라는 뜻이지만, 너무 유명해진 나머지 진심보다는 뻔한 핑계로 들리는 경우가 많다. 그래서 요즘은 진지한 상황보다 이 클리셰 자체를 놀리는 농담으로 더 자주 쓴다.','So why did you two break up?','그래서 너네 둘 왜 헤어진 거야?','He gave me the classic "it''s not you, it''s me."','걔가 그 뻔한 "네 탓이 아니라 내 문제야"를 시전하더라.',ARRAY['He','gave','me','the','classic','it''s','not','you','it''s','me']::varchar[],ARRAY['classical','me','it''s','He','gave','it''s','gives','not','the','you','classic','its','me']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "I said, \"It''s not you, it''s me,\" and she rolled her eyes.", "highlightingPart": "It''s not you, it''s me", "sentenceTranslation": "\"네 탓이 아니라 내 문제야\"라고 했더니 걔가 눈을 굴리더라.", "practiceQuestion": "How did she take it when you ended things?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너가 끝내자고 했을 때 걔 반응 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/711/practice-examples/248df12c-7a04-436b-ad1e-73602f69c968.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "said", "It''s", "not", "you", "it''s", "me", "and", "she", "rolled", "her", "eyes"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["her", "and", "rolled", "its", "eyes", "said", "you", "says", "not", "me", "it''s", "I", "she", "eye", "It''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s not you guys, it''s me. I just need sleep.", "highlightingPart": "It''s not you guys, it''s me", "sentenceTranslation": "너네 문제가 아니라 내 문제야. 나 그냥 잠이 필요해.", "practiceQuestion": "Are you really quitting our study group?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 진짜 우리 스터디 그만두는 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/711/practice-examples/127fd0d9-037d-490d-87ef-104ecb19c4dd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "not", "you", "guys", "it''s", "me", "I", "just", "need", "sleep"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it''s", "I", "me", "guys", "need", "It''s", "sleep", "just", "you", "its", "not", "guy", "needs"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s not you, it''s me. I can''t handle spice.", "highlightingPart": "It''s not you, it''s me", "sentenceTranslation": "네 탓이 아니라 내 문제야. 나 매운 걸 못 먹어.", "practiceQuestion": "Why won''t you try my kimchi stew?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "내가 만든 김치찌개 왜 안 먹어봐?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/711/practice-examples/ec0d486d-2729-4de7-a6b2-42009f8fcb35.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "not", "you", "it''s", "me", "I", "can''t", "handle", "spice"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["spice", "can''t", "it''s", "It''s", "handles", "its", "handle", "you", "me", "I", "spices", "not"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sure, but \"it''s not you, it''s me\" always sounds like an excuse.", "highlightingPart": "it''s not you, it''s me", "sentenceTranslation": "있지, 근데 그 말은 항상 핑계처럼 들려.", "practiceQuestion": "Do people actually say that line in real life?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 대사를 실제로 쓰는 사람이 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/711/practice-examples/a8199d74-70c7-405f-a72c-9c6288cc83b9.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sure", "but", "it''s", "not", "you", "it''s", "me", "always", "sounds", "like", "an", "excuse"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["sound", "like", "excuse", "it''s", "but", "me", "excuses", "it''s", "sounds", "not", "Sure", "its", "an", "always", "you"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.00857543945,-0.00944519043,-0.0407714844,-0.0100021362,0.0213775635,0.0364074707,0.0358276367,0.00360679626,-0.0226287842,0.0434570312,-0.0116577148,-0.0380859375,0.0252532959,-0.00436782837,-0.0140075684,-0.00329399109,-0.0357055664,0.0453491211,-0.015083313,0.0141067505,0.0181884766,0.0118865967,0.0322570801,0.0162658691,0.0256195068,0.00517654419,-0.00540542603,0.0175170898,0.0472412109,0.0563354492,-0.0211791992,-0.0130310059,0.0381164551,-0.0335693359,-0.00297737122,0.0694580078,0.0228424072,0.0197601318,-0.0204315186,-0.0472717285,0.0307922363,0.0166320801,0.0120773315,-0.0230560303,0.0240020752,0.0209960938,0.007