(721,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',558,'top-notch','최상급의, 일류의','일류 인증 top-notch','품질이나 서비스가 최고 수준이라고 한 단어로 극찬할 때 쓰는 형용사다. notch는 눈금이라는 뜻으로, 눈금 맨 위 칸이라는 데서 나온 표현이다. 오래 쓰여 온 말이라 리뷰, 추천, 일상 대화 어디에나 무난하게 어울린다.','How was the service at that hotel?','그 호텔 서비스 어땠어?','The service was top-notch from start to finish.','서비스가 처음부터 끝까지 일류였어.',ARRAY['The','service','was','top-notch','from','start','to','finish']::varchar[],ARRAY['to','starts','was','start','service','finish','services','from','top-notch','The','were']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Totally. The broth is top-notch.", "highlightingPart": "top-notch", "sentenceTranslation": "완전. 국물이 최상급이야.", "practiceQuestion": "Is that new ramen place worth the line?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 새로 생긴 라멘집 줄 서서 먹을 만해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/721/practice-examples/2602a51c-61ab-401a-b4a0-3147e9390aac.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Totally", "The", "broth", "is", "top-notch"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["are", "broths", "The", "Total", "is", "broth", "Totally", "top-notch"]}, {"sentenceText": "Honestly, her lectures are top-notch.", "highlightingPart": "top-notch", "sentenceTranslation": "솔직히 강의가 일류야.", "practiceQuestion": "How''s your new professor this semester?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이번 학기 새 교수님 어때?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/721/practice-examples/466361e0-6452-4896-aaa0-b519a9578c13.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Honestly", "her", "lectures", "are", "top-notch"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["is", "hers", "lectures", "Honestly", "top-notch", "are", "her", "lecture"]}, {"sentenceText": "Not top-notch, but it did the job.", "highlightingPart": "top-notch", "sentenceTranslation": "최상급은 아니었는데 쓸 만은 했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Was the gear they rented us any good?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔네가 빌려준 장비 쓸 만했어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/721/practice-examples/5bdbfa42-0706-4e7a-86a2-a680ca287e56.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Not", "top-notch", "but", "it", "did", "the", "job"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["but", "top-notch", "jobs", "Not", "the", "does", "did", "job", "it", "its"]}, {"sentenceText": "Cheap beds, but top-notch location.", "highlightingPart": "top-notch", "sentenceTranslation": "침대는 싸구려인데 위치가 끝내주거든.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you keep going back to that hostel?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 호스텔 왜 자꾸 다시 가?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/721/practice-examples/d333f907-042f-4e66-a6ad-d80ba9ac1264.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Cheap", "beds", "but", "top-notch", "location"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Cheaply", "bed", "but", "beds", "location", "locations", "top-notch", "Cheap"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.00616455078,0.00677108765,-0.0604248047,0.0257873535,0.0180969238,-0.0115890503,-0.0141220093,0.0633544922,0.0124816895,-0.0185699463,0.0444335938,0.00221824646,-0.0226287842,-0.0338134766,0.0497741699,0.030166626,-0.0853271484,-0.0263519287,0.00164222717,0.0186767578,0.0244598389,-0.00887298584,-0.00121498108,0.0285339355,0.0281829834,-0.006275177,-0.036315918,0.0202331543,0.036529541,-0.0108261108,0.0166168213,-0.0469055176,0.0625610352,-0.0291290283,-0.000885009766,0.00674819946,0.0624389648,0.00682067871,0.0250396729,-0.0415344238,-0.0083770752,0.0316772461,0.0230865479,-0.00611495972,0.0625610352,-0.0174407959,0.0155410767,0.0131225586,-0.00758361816,0.0110244751,-0.00183296204,0.0534057617,0.0349731445,-0.00997924805,-0.00361442566,0.00845336914,0.00537490845,0.00538635254,0.030166626,-0.049041748,-0.000646591187,-0.018737793,0.0418395996,0.00260162354,-0.014793396,-0.073059082,-0.0351867676,0.038848877,0.0101394653,-0.00438308716,0.050201416,-0.0227661133,-0.0498657227,0.032623291,0.0235595703,-0.0231018066,-0.033416748,0.0150527954,0.0283508301,-0.0372619629,-0.0177764893,-0.016494751,-0.0324707031,0.0198364258,0.0115127563,-0.0314941406,-0.0527954102,-0.