(723,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',560,'hold up','시간이 지나도 여전히 좋다, 퀄리티가 유지되다','세월 무시 명작 hold up','옛날 작품이나 물건이 세월이 지나도 퀄리티가 죽지 않았다고 평가할 때 쓰는 표현이다. "this movie still holds up"처럼 still과 자주 붙어 다니며, 옛 명작 재평가 댓글의 단골 문장이다. 반대로 doesn''t hold up이라고 하면 지금 보면 별로라는 뜻이 된다.','Is that movie from the 90s still worth watching?','그 90년대 영화 지금 봐도 볼만해?','Definitely. It still holds up today.','당연하지. 지금 봐도 여전히 좋아.',ARRAY['Definitely','It','still','holds','up','today']::varchar[],ARRAY['It','still','Definite','hold','Definitely','holds','its','up','today']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Yeah, the gameplay totally holds up.", "highlightingPart": "holds up", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 게임성은 지금 해도 완전 살아 있어.", "practiceQuestion": "Should I replay that old game everyone loved?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "다들 좋아했던 그 옛날 게임 다시 해볼까?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/723/practice-examples/111d9ea3-1739-430a-aee8-e31a4aaaa480.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yeah", "the", "gameplay", "totally", "holds", "up"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["total", "totally", "hold", "Yeah", "the", "gameplay", "up", "holds"]}, {"sentenceText": "Honestly, some jokes don''t hold up anymore.", "highlightingPart": "hold up", "sentenceTranslation": "솔직히 몇몇 개그는 이제 안 통하더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Did that comedy feel dated when you rewatched it?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 코미디 다시 보니까 촌스러웠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/723/practice-examples/55e080ef-2e8a-4ad5-a8ba-ddc35eae1292.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Honestly", "some", "jokes", "don''t", "hold", "up", "anymore"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["some", "up", "Honestly", "don''t", "holds", "hold", "joke", "doesn''t", "anymore", "jokes"]}, {"sentenceText": "The sound holds up better than new ones.", "highlightingPart": "holds up", "sentenceTranslation": "음질이 요즘 것보다 여전히 좋거든.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you still use those old headphones?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 오래된 헤드폰 왜 아직 써?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/723/practice-examples/0f4750d0-0033-4699-854e-7103f6a2a3fe.webp", "sentenceWords": ["The", "sound", "holds", "up", "better", "than", "new", "ones"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["one", "sound", "than", "The", "better", "hold", "then", "up", "holds", "new", "ones"]}, {"sentenceText": "Surprisingly, it''s held up for years.", "highlightingPart": "held up", "sentenceTranslation": "놀랍게도 몇 년째 멀쩡해.", "practiceQuestion": "Is your dorm''s ancient couch still okay?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너네 기숙사 그 낡은 소파 아직 괜찮아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/723/practice-examples/bac74a3f-51f6-4b63-8189-095b6a5f188b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Surprisingly", "it''s", "held", "up", "for", "years"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["its", "year", "for", "Surprisingly", "held", "up", "hold", "years", "it''s"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0433959961,-0.0119018555,-0.0631103516,-0.0158996582,-0.0281829834,0.0195617676,-0.00639343262,0.0189056396,0.0117034912,-0.00450515747,0.0196685791,-0.0390625,-0.0228881836,-0.0402526855,-0.013420105,-0.00102806091,-0.0758056641,-0.0083770752,-0.00658798218,0.034362793,-0.00885009766,0.00420761108,0.00310134888,0.0568847656,0.0132217407,0.0300750732,0.00491714478,0.0127944946,0.027557373,0.0391235352,0.0189819336,-0.0326538086,-0.0017824173,-0.0242462158,-0.0293273926,0.0299377441,-0.0298614502,-0.0163421631,-0.0264587402,-0.049041748,0.0258789062,-0.0512390137,0.0213317871,-0.033203125,0.0449523926,0.0745849609,0.0143814087,-0.0374145508,0.025604248,0.0510559082,0.0291137695,0.0202026367,-0.0140914917,0.016418457,0.0315246582,-0.041809082,-0.0132598877,0.0114135742,0.00468826294,-0.0105819702,0.036895752,-0.0487060547,-0.00482940674,0.0186004639,-0.029296875,-0.000911235809,0.000980377197,0.0458068848,-0.0103225708,0.0428771973,-0.0140914917,-0.00469207764,0.0174713135,-0.0175170898,-0.0143814087,0.0246276855,0.00930786133,0.0241