(774,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',611,'here and there','여기저기서, 드문드문','드문드문 여기저기 here and there','장소나 분량을 뭉뚱그려 "여기저기, 드문드문" 하고 말하는 표현이다. "I''ve made changes here and there"처럼 전체가 아니라 산발적으로 조금씩 했다는 뉘앙스를 전한다. 시간에 대해 쓰면 "짬짬이, 틈틈이"라는 느낌도 낼 수 있다.','Did you rewrite the whole essay?','에세이 전체를 다시 쓴 거야?','No, I just made changes here and there.','아니, 그냥 여기저기 조금씩 고쳤어.',ARRAY['No','I','just','made','changes','here','and','there']::varchar[],ARRAY['makes','changes','made','just','I','change','their','and','here','No','there']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Just a few words here and there.", "highlightingPart": "here and there", "sentenceTranslation": "그냥 여기저기 주워들은 단어 몇 개 정도.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you know Spanish?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 스페인어 할 줄 알아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/774/practice-examples/79523e95-301e-4e6d-8567-0b403b436fb0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Just", "a", "few", "words", "here", "and", "there"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["here", "word", "fewer", "words", "a", "few", "there", "Just", "and", "their"]}, {"sentenceText": "Here and there, but nothing that ruined our plans.", "highlightingPart": "Here and there", "sentenceTranslation": "드문드문 왔는데, 계획 망칠 정도는 아니었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did it rain during your trip?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "여행 중에 비 왔어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/774/practice-examples/ebe6d51f-1a15-417f-8af7-da8df978d888.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Here", "and", "there", "but", "nothing", "that", "ruined", "our", "plans"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["nothing", "that", "plans", "there", "and", "our", "Here", "anything", "but", "their", "ruins", "ruined"]}, {"sentenceText": "Here and there, whenever I get a free hour.", "highlightingPart": "Here and there", "sentenceTranslation": "짬짬이 해, 한 시간 빌 때마다.", "practiceQuestion": "Have you been exercising lately?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "요즘 운동 좀 하고 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/774/practice-examples/f8875a54-2711-4177-9d0d-eb4dd0bbc777.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Here", "and", "there", "whenever", "I", "get", "a", "free", "hour"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["hour", "there", "their", "free", "hours", "gets", "get", "whenever", "and", "Here", "I", "a"]}, {"sentenceText": "There are scratches here and there, but it''s fine.", "highlightingPart": "here and there", "sentenceTranslation": "여기저기 긁힌 자국은 있는데, 쓸 만해.", "practiceQuestion": "Is the dorm furniture in bad shape?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "기숙사 가구 상태 많이 안 좋아?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/774/practice-examples/017dcf84-c1ed-489e-bd11-c896f2b87b8b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["There", "are", "scratches", "here", "and", "there", "but", "it''s", "fine"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["there", "fine", "their", "but", "here", "are", "is", "scratch", "and", "There", "scratches", "it''s"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0217132568,-0.0140304565,-0.0168457031,-0.0185852051,0.00878143311,-0.000912189484,0.0193634033,0.047668457,-0.0206451416,0.032409668,-0.0250549316,-0.00914001465,0.0546264648,-0.0008020401,-0.0142364502,0.0307312012,-0.0337524414,0.0463867188,0.0293884277,0.0579528809,0.022644043,-0.0144729614,-0.00305747986,0.0314331055,0.0232696533,0.0294647217,0.0170898438,0.028137207,0.0415039062,0.00370597839,0.0148544312,-0.033203125,0.0354309082,-0.0464477539,-0.00196266174,0.0527038574,0.0501403809,0.0518493652,0.0110168457,-0.0698242188,0.017578125,-0.000324487686,0.0399169922,-0.0126800537,0.00444793701,0.021697998,0.00465774536,-0.00742340088,0.0159759521,0.0140762329,-0.000730514526,-0.000482559204,-0.0304107666,0.0178833008,-0.020904541,-0.0146102905,-0.0524902344,0.0411071777,0.0315246582,-0.0520019531,0.0676269531,-0.0305328369,0.0556335449,0.0578613281,-0.00279045105,0.0362548828,-0.000751495361,-0.0178833008,0.0178833008,0.00757598877,0.0218200684,-0.00357246399,-0.0379333496,0.002578