(778,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',615,'basically','한마디로, 요컨대','요약 도입 basically','복잡한 내용을 "한마디로, 요컨대" 하고 줄여서 설명할 때 문장 앞에 붙이는 초상용 필러다. 디테일을 걷어내고 핵심만 전달하겠다는 신호라서 설명을 시작하거나 요약할 때 자연스럽다. 너무 자주 쓰면 말버릇처럼 들릴 수 있으니 남용은 주의한다.','What''s this drama even about?','이 드라마 대체 무슨 내용이야?','Basically, two enemies end up falling in love.','한마디로, 원수 둘이 사랑에 빠지는 얘기야.',ARRAY['Basically','two','enemies','end','up','falling','in','love']::varchar[],ARRAY['love','Basically','in','end','falling','basic','enemies','ends','fell','two','up']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Basically, half the team got sick.", "highlightingPart": "Basically", "sentenceTranslation": "요컨대, 팀 절반이 아파서.", "practiceQuestion": "Why did the group meeting get canceled?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "조모임 왜 취소된 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/778/practice-examples/9ac4b7c2-1de3-43ad-9edf-f88f330c1816.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Basically", "half", "the", "team", "got", "sick"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["gets", "half", "sick", "the", "basic", "got", "team", "teams", "Basically"]}, {"sentenceText": "Basically, you keep it as long as your grades stay up.", "highlightingPart": "Basically", "sentenceTranslation": "한마디로, 성적만 유지하면 계속 받는 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "How does this scholarship work?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이 장학금 어떻게 되는 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/778/practice-examples/5894ca44-9a79-4cab-a603-dcc6cf9e93fd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Basically", "you", "keep", "it", "as", "long", "as", "your", "grades", "stay", "up"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["long", "grades", "as", "stays", "it", "you", "your", "basic", "stay", "as", "up", "Basically", "keeps", "keep"]}, {"sentenceText": "Basically, he''ll fix it next week.", "highlightingPart": "Basically", "sentenceTranslation": "요컨대, 다음 주에 고쳐 준대.", "practiceQuestion": "What did the landlord say about the leak?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "집주인이 누수에 대해 뭐래?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/778/practice-examples/c846585f-7a95-4989-8c16-82d141e6612c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Basically", "he''ll", "fix", "it", "next", "week"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["weeks", "fix", "he''ll", "it", "week", "Basically", "next", "fixes", "basic"]}, {"sentenceText": "Basically, the best week of my life.", "highlightingPart": "Basically", "sentenceTranslation": "한마디로, 내 인생 최고의 일주일.", "practiceQuestion": "So how was the whole trip in one sentence?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그래서 이번 여행 한 줄로 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/778/practice-examples/dfee861a-7970-4224-8851-2d34d3d213b9.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Basically", "the", "best", "week", "of", "my", "life"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["best", "basic", "better", "of", "the", "lives", "my", "week", "life", "Basically"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[-0.00845336914,-0.00494766235,-0.0383300781,0.0263977051,-0.00125408173,-0.0127334595,0.00480651855,0.0501708984,-0.00615310669,0.0356140137,0.0197906494,-0.0372009277,-0.0114364624,0.0148086548,0.00762939453,0.0139465332,-0.0404663086,0.0231323242,0.0419006348,0.0477600098,0.0254516602,0.0128555298,0.0373840332,0.0682983398,-0.00680541992,-0.0521850586,-0.0193328857,0.0180206299,0.00827026367,-0.0303344727,-0.000991821289,-0.0379638672,0.00701141357,-0.021270752,0.0464172363,-0.00660324097,0.0279083252,0.029510498,0.00305175781,-0.0641479492,0.0280914307,-0.0420837402,0.0292816162,0.0295410156,-0.0251159668,0.0374145508,-0.0102157593,-0.0123214722,0.00109195709,0.00601196289,-0.0210418701,-0.0283813477,0.0372619629,0.024810791,-0.0144805908,-0.0159912109,0.0142288208,-0.00765609741,-0.00298881531,-0.0191650391,0.00882720947,-0.0133972168,0.0540466309,0.0393066406,-0.0185089111,0.0339355469,0.00704956055,0.0397338867,0.0296173096,0.0207519531,0.00239944458,-0.0376586914,-0.033416748,-0.0181884766,0.00552749634,0.0479431152,-0.030166626,0.0586242676,0.000801