(784,NULL,'TIME_PLANNING','BASIC','EN','KR',621,'take forever','한참 걸리다, 하세월이다','하세월 불평 take forever','직역하면 "영원히 걸린다"로, 뭔가가 너무 오래 걸릴 때 하는 과장 섞인 불평이다. 로딩, 줄 서기, 배송처럼 기다리는 상황이면 어디든 쓴다. is taking forever처럼 진행형으로 말하면 지금 기다리다 지친 느낌이 잘 산다.','Why are you so late?','왜 이렇게 늦었어?','Sorry, the bus took forever to come.','미안, 버스가 하세월이었어.',ARRAY['Sorry','the','bus','took','forever','to','come']::varchar[],ARRAY['comes','buses','bus','Sorry','took','come','takes','to','forever','the']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Barely. Every page takes forever to load.", "highlightingPart": "takes forever", "sentenceTranslation": "겨우. 페이지마다 로딩이 하세월이야.", "practiceQuestion": "Is the registration site working?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "수강신청 사이트 되냐?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/784/practice-examples/25c028ba-ea75-4a2c-a05c-178e159942bb.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Barely", "Every", "page", "takes", "forever", "to", "load"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["load", "pages", "to", "page", "loads", "Barely", "take", "forever", "Every", "takes"]}, {"sentenceText": "Finally, but shipping took forever.", "highlightingPart": "took forever", "sentenceTranslation": "드디어 왔는데 배송이 한참 걸렸어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did your package arrive?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "택배 왔어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/784/practice-examples/2ddcd560-1da5-47bc-ae14-99a758ff212f.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Finally", "but", "shipping", "took", "forever"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["final", "forever", "shipping", "takes", "Finally", "ships", "but", "took"]}, {"sentenceText": "The line was taking forever, so we gave up.", "highlightingPart": "taking forever", "sentenceTranslation": "줄이 하세월이라 포기했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Why didn''t you eat at that famous place?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 유명한 데서 왜 안 먹었어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/784/practice-examples/3c58bbb7-7ee5-4692-b5d4-11b6b148b0e8.webp