(819,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',656,'go figure','참 알다가도 모를 일이야','아이러니 으쓱 go figure','앞뒤가 안 맞거나 아이러니한 상황에 어깨를 으쓱하며 던지는 리액션이다. "설명해 보라니까, 나도 모르겠다"는 어감으로, "참 알다가도 모를 일이야" 정도에 해당한다. 살짝 냉소가 섞인 캐주얼한 표현이라 진지한 자리보다는 수다에 어울린다.','The day we planned the picnic, it poured. But today''s perfect.','소풍 잡은 날엔 비가 퍼붓더니, 오늘은 날이 완벽하네.','Go figure. The weather only cooperates when we don''t need it.','알다가도 모를 일이야. 날씨는 꼭 필요 없을 때만 좋다니까.',ARRAY['Go','figure','The','weather','only','cooperates','when','we','don''t','need','it']::varchar[],ARRAY['figures','need','cooperate','it','when','Go','Goes','cooperates','don''t','weather','we','only','The','figure']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Go figure. The fancy one gave us stale toast.", "highlightingPart": "Go figure", "sentenceTranslation": "참 모를 일이야. 비싼 데는 눅눅한 토스트 줬는데.", "practiceQuestion": "The cheapest hostel ended up having the best breakfast.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "제일 싼 호스텔이 조식은 제일 잘 나오더라.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/819/practice-examples/e4f7ec9c-2e77-4196-8911-9c6858bd39e0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Go", "figure", "The", "fancy", "one", "gave", "us", "stale", "toast"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["stale", "The", "us", "toast", "gave", "Goes", "figures", "figure", "one", "fancy", "Go", "give"]}, {"sentenceText": "Go figure. Some people just have it.", "highlightingPart": "Go figure", "sentenceTranslation": "알다가도 모를 일이지. 타고나는 애들이 있다니까.", "practiceQuestion": "He never studies, but he aced the exam again.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 공부 하나도 안 하는데 또 시험 만점이래.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/819/practice-examples/10c43b2c-6af4-4c9e-bc52-38d79c8bed83.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Go", "figure", "Some", "people", "just", "have", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Some", "has", "figures", "Go", "have", "Goes", "just", "it", "people", "figure"]}, {"sentenceText": "Go figure. Mine only dies during deadlines.", "highlightingPart": "Go figure", "sentenceTranslation": "참 신기하지. 내 건 꼭 마감 때만 죽어.", "practiceQuestion": "The Wi-Fi works everywhere except my room.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "와이파이가 내 방만 빼고 다 잘 터져.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/819/practice-examples/617d546b-2388-42f8-a4eb-129b90203bb7.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Go", "figure", "Mine", "only", "dies", "during", "deadlines"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Goes", "Mine", "deadlines", "figure", "die", "Go", "only", "dies", "figures", "during"]}, {"sentenceText": "Go figure. That''s just how it works.", "highlightingPart": "Go figure", "sentenceTranslation": "알다가도 모를 일이야. 세상이 원래 그렇다니까.", "practiceQuestion": "I finally bought a raincoat, and now it hasn''t rained in weeks.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "드디어 우비 샀더니 몇 주째 비가 안 와.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/819/practice-examples/275b8c83-58a2-438a-8598-9ce55529d2c3.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Go", "figure", "That''s", "just", "how", "it", "works"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["That''s", "Go", "works", "how", "just", "figure", "Goes", "work", "figures", "it"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[-0.00453948975,-0.0233764648,-0.0704345703,-0.0210266113,-0.00517654419,-0.023147583,0.00659942627,-0.00666427612,-0.0281982422,-0.0238342285,-0.00612640381,-0.0132141113,-0.0140075684,-0.0286407471,-0.0022315979,-0.0331726074,-0.049407959,-0.00791168213,-0.0202331543,0.0103530884,-0.000928401947,0.00156021118,-0.00671005249,-0.01512146,0.0176391602,0.00849151611,-0.0553588867,0.0144958496,0.0194549561,0.00625991821,0.00199127197,-0.0351867676,0.063293457,-0.0724487305,-0.0155715942,0.0160827637,0.0121383667,-0.0419006348,0.017578125,-0.0661621094,0.00814819336,0.0145492554,0.0299682617,-0.0252838135,0.0076713562,0.0241699219,-0.0191955566,0.0355529785,0.0290679932,0.0255889893,0.0256500244,0.0290679932,-0.00490570068,0.0690307617,-0.0613098145,0.00406265259,-0.000642299652,0.0291290283,0.0217285156,-0.0157470703,