(854,NULL,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',691,'speak for itself','(설명 필요 없이) 그 자체로 증명하다','결과가 증명 speak for itself','굳이 말로 설명하지 않아도 결과나 실력이 스스로 말해준다는 표현이다. "the results speak for themselves(결과가 다 말해준다)"처럼 복수형으로도 자주 쓴다. 자랑을 길게 늘어놓는 대신 이 한마디로 끝내면 오히려 더 자신감 있게 들린다.','Do you really think that study method works?','그 공부법 진짜 효과 있다고 생각해?','I went from a C to an A. The results speak for themselves.','C에서 A로 올랐어. 결과가 다 말해주지.',ARRAY['I','went','from','a','C','to','an','A','The','results','speak','for','themselves']::varchar[],ARRAY['speaks','an','themselves','results','C','to','speak','A','itself','goes','went','from','for','I','The','a']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "The line speaks for itself. People wait an hour.", "highlightingPart": "speaks for itself", "sentenceTranslation": "그 줄이 다 말해주잖아. 다들 한 시간씩 기다려.", "practiceQuestion": "Is that bakery really worth the long line?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 빵집 진짜 줄 서서 먹을 만해?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/854/practice-examples/a4935c21-7042-42bd-8735-6942c55f12be.webp", "sentenceWords": ["The", "line", "speaks", "for", "itself", "People", "wait", "an", "hour"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["speak", "speaks", "waits", "themselves", "wait", "an", "The", "hour", "People", "line", "itself", "for"]}, {"sentenceText": "He didn''t need to. His data spoke for itself.", "highlightingPart": "spoke for itself", "sentenceTranslation": "그럴 필요가 없었지. 데이터가 알아서 증명했으니까.", "practiceQuestion": "Why didn''t he defend himself in the debate?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔 토론에서 왜 반박 안 했대?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/854/practice-examples/e2ba1407-2dfd-45ab-b298-22f01e0add95.webp", "sentenceWords": ["He", "didn''t", "need", "to", "His", "data", "spoke", "for", "itself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["His", "data", "doesn''t", "need", "He", "didn''t", "for", "itself", "spoke", "speaks", "to", "themselves"]}, {"sentenceText": "Just show last year''s festival video. It speaks for itself.", "highlightingPart": "speaks for itself", "sentenceTranslation": "작년 축제 영상만 보여줘. 그게 다 말해줘.", "practiceQuestion": "How do I convince people our club is fun?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "우리 동아리 재밌다는 걸 어떻게 어필하지?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/854/practice-examples/74709f6e-994e-488a-80cc-81eb539d9d6b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Just", "show", "last", "year''s", "festival", "video", "It", "speaks", "for", "itself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["festival", "It", "show", "year''s", "Just", "video", "itself", "themselves", "last", "for", "speak", "speaks", "shows"]}, {"sentenceText": "Not much. He just said the score speaks for itself.", "highlightingPart": "speaks for itself", "sentenceTranslation": "별로. 점수가 다 말해준다고만 하시더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Did the coach praise your team after the win?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이기고 나서 코치님이 너희 팀 칭찬하셨어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/854/practice-examples/b6eb4e5f-3fa7-4b26-90b9-6dd006bd0903.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Not", "much", "He", "just", "said", "the", "score", "speaks", "for", "itself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["itself", "Not", "much", "He", "just", "says", "score", "speaks", "said", "for", "themselves", "the", "speak"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0313110352,-0.0107650757,-0.0661621094,-0.00764465332,0.0170898438,-0.00835418701,-0.0393066406,0.0170898438,0.033203125,-0.00713348389,0.0273132324,-0.0129241943,-0.00312614441,-0.0735473633,-0.00344085693,-0.0279083252,-0.0676879883,0.0122299194,-0.0121688843,-0.0298461914,-0.00262260437,0.00386428833,0.0185241699,0.0364685059,0.0229644775,0.0160064697,-0.040222168,0.0396728516,0.0305633545,-0.0179443359,-0.029006958,-0.0338439941,0.0474243164,-0.0809326172,-0.0148010254,0.0309906006,0.0178985596,-0.0802612305,0.0148696899,-0.0308227539,0.0357666016,0.00468063354,-0.00551605225,0.0129470825,0.0174713135,0.0616760254,-0.00629043579,0.0123