(869,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','BASIC','EN','KR',706,'to top it all off','결정적으로, 마지막 하이라이트로','결정타 얹기 to top it all off','여러 가지를 나열한 뒤 마지막 정점을 얹을 때 쓰는 표현이다. 케이크 위에 마지막 장식을 올리는 이미지로, 최악의 하루의 결정타든 완벽한 하루의 화룡점정이든 양쪽 다 쓸 수 있다. on top of that이 중간에 하나씩 쌓는 느낌이라면, 이건 이야기의 클라이맥스를 알리는 신호다.','So how did the road trip disaster end?','그래서 그 로드트립 대참사는 어떻게 끝났어?','And to top it all off, the car broke down at midnight.','그리고 결정적으로, 자정에 차까지 퍼졌어.',ARRAY['And','to','top','it','all','off','the','car','broke','down','at','midnight']::varchar[],ARRAY['all','the','tops','it','at','broke','down','broken','car','of','midnight','top','off','And','to']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Perfect — and to top it all off, the chef brought out free cake.", "highlightingPart": "to top it all off", "sentenceTranslation": "완벽했지, 화룡점정으로 셰프가 공짜 케이크까지 줬어.", "practiceQuestion": "How was the birthday dinner you planned?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "네가 준비한 생일 저녁은 어땠어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/869/practice-examples/2ca2d4c3-17fd-4479-b025-9773ab14500a.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Perfect", "and", "to", "top", "it", "all", "off", "the", "chef", "brought", "out", "free", "cake"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["and", "to", "off", "cake", "bring", "free", "top", "tops", "chef", "the", "Perfect", "all", "it", "out", "brought", "of"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yep, and to top it all off, they lost my luggage.", "highlightingPart": "to top it all off", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 결정타로 내 짐까지 잃어버렸더라.", "practiceQuestion": "Your flight got delayed AND canceled?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "비행기가 지연됐다가 취소까지 됐다고?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/869/practice-examples/84110b75-320c-4ec7-920b-c5857e78f8b0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yep", "and", "to", "top", "it", "all", "off", "they", "lost", "my", "luggage"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["of", "my", "luggage", "tops", "they", "lost", "top", "lose", "off", "to", "all", "Yep", "and", "it"]}, {"sentenceText": "To top it all off, my laptop died mid-exam.", "highlightingPart": "To top it all off", "sentenceTranslation": "결정적으로 시험 도중에 노트북이 꺼졌어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did anything else go wrong during finals week?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "기말 주간에 또 뭐 잘못된 거 있었어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/869/practice-examples/56032438-85f8-4206-b327-972e66cb77be.webp", "sentenceWords": ["To", "top", "it", "all", "off", "my", "laptop", "died", "mid-exam"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["tops", "it", "To", "laptop", "died", "off", "mid-exam", "of", "top", "my", "all", "dead"]}, {"sentenceText": "It was, and to top it all off, we got backstage passes.", "highlightingPart": "to top it all off", "sentenceTranslation": "좋았지, 마지막 하이라이트로 백스테이지 출입증까지 받았어.", "practiceQuestion": "Sounds like the festival was actually amazing.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 페스티벌 진짜 좋았나 보네.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/869/practice-examples/5e662a70-f29c-43c0-9e52-e3e3862ffe83.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It", "was", "and", "to", "top", "it", "all", "off", "we", "got", "backstage", "passes"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["got", "off", "and", "backstage", "we", "tops", "to", "all", "get", "passes", "was", "top", "it", "It", "of"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.027557373,-0.0128097534,-0.048034668,0.0339050293,-0.0353088379,-0.0260467529,0.0136108398,0.0231781006,0.000495910645,-0.000534057617,0.0249023438,0.0151062012,-0.0359191895,-0.0435180664,0.0433654785,-0.00645828247,-0.0567016602,0.0462341309,0.0295715332,0.0562744141,-0.0172271729,-0.0284881592,0.028503418,0.0454406738,0.00983428955,0.0242004395,-0.00672912598,0.0243835449,0.039642334,-0.0246429443,-0.0103378296,-0.0313110352,0.0148468018,-0.0387573242,0.0221557617,0.0141296387,0.0420532227,-0.0247497559,-0.00854492188,-0.0265960693,0.0357971191,-0.00836181641,0.0178985596,-0.00635528564,0.0325622559,-0.00853729248,0.019744873,0.0136108398,-0.02427673