(872,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','SLANG_NEOLOGISM','EN','KR',709,'can''t unsee it','한 번 보면 잊히지 않는다, 자꾸 그것만 보인다','한번 보면 못 잊음 can''t unsee it','뭔가를 한번 인지하고 나면 되돌릴 수 없이 계속 그것만 보인다는 인터넷발 표현이다. unsee는 ''본 것을 안 본 상태로 되돌리다''라는 뜻의 신조어로, 웃긴 닮은꼴부터 충격적인 장면까지 폭넓게 쓴다. 댓글창 단골 멘트이며, "now I can''t unsee it(이제 그것만 보이잖아)"처럼 원망 섞인 농담으로 자주 등장한다.','Doesn''t that cloud look exactly like a screaming cat?','저 구름 완전 비명 지르는 고양이처럼 안 생겼어?','Oh no, now I can''t unsee it.','아 진짜, 이제 그것만 보이잖아.',ARRAY['Oh','no','now','I','can''t','unsee','it']::varchar[],ARRAY['now','know','unsee','unseen','I','can''t','no','can','it','Oh']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Why would you tell me that? I can''t unsee it now.", "highlightingPart": "can''t unsee it", "sentenceTranslation": "그걸 왜 말해줘? 이제 그렇게만 보이잖아.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you notice the logo looks like two ducks fighting?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "저 로고 오리 두 마리 싸우는 것처럼 보이는 거 알았어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/872/practice-examples/c30b2e44-4c81-4ddc-8f8d-137bcd9cc06a.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Why", "would", "you", "tell", "me", "that", "I", "can''t", "unsee", "it", "now"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["tell", "would", "Why", "now", "tells", "can", "can''t", "I", "unseen", "me", "that", "unsee", "it", "you"]}, {"sentenceText": "I can''t unsee it. Lectures are ruined forever.", "highlightingPart": "can''t unsee it", "sentenceTranslation": "한번 보이니까 안 잊혀. 수업 다 망했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Our professor totally looks like a cartoon villain, right?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "우리 교수님 완전 만화 악당 닮았지?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/872/practice-examples/92792fe9-3391-4ae1-b0c3-d927ab106f4f.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "can''t", "unsee", "it", "Lectures", "are", "ruined", "forever"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it", "is", "I", "ruin", "can''t", "Lectures", "are", "unsee", "ruined", "unseen", "forever"]}, {"sentenceText": "Someone said the hands are weird, and now I can''t unsee them.", "highlightingPart": "can''t unsee them", "sentenceTranslation": "누가 손이 이상하다고 했는데, 이제 손만 보여.", "practiceQuestion": "Why do you keep staring at that painting?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그 그림을 왜 자꾸 쳐다봐?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/872/practice-examples/ed6586d3-0ec4-40c3-a6ec-2a123c2885f4.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Someone", "said", "the", "hands", "are", "weird", "and", "now", "I", "can''t", "unsee", "them"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["are", "weird", "Someone", "unseen", "hands", "I", "them", "and", "now", "can''t", "the", "unsee", "hand", "said", "say"]}, {"sentenceText": "Too late — I can''t unsee it every time I come here.", "highlightingPart": "can''t unsee it", "sentenceTranslation": "늦었어, 여기 올 때마다 그것만 보인다고.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry for pointing out the typo on the menu.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "메뉴판 오타 지적해서 미안.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/872/practice-examples/1a8a0f59-4637-477a-8068-731cb440a801.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Too", "late", "I", "can''t", "unsee", "it", "every", "time", "I", "come", "here"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it", "comes", "can''t", "here", "come", "I", "time", "Too", "every", "I", "unsee", "unseen", "late", "to"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0132369995,0.00197029114,-0.0836181641,0.0416870117,-0.0227050781,-0.0175933838,0.0343322754,0.00785827637,0.01953125,0.0104522705,0.0278015137,-0.0256958008,0.0290222168,0.0144882202,0.0235443115,-0.00427246094,-0.0448608398,-0.00448226929,0.0280303955,0.0232086182,0.0394592285,-0.00103092194,0.0100708008,0.0251922607,0.0205078125,0.00840759277,0.0119094849,0.0166625977,0.0632324219,0.0342712402,0.0147094727,-0.0335693359,0.0346069336,-0.0134811401,-0.00301742554,0.0385437012,0.0165252686,-0.00522994995,-0.0358581543,0.0135192871,0.0333251953,0.00393295288,0.056060791,-0.0272674561,0.0791015625,0.0412902832,-0.0252380371,0.0387573242,-0.00981140137,0.00356483459,-0.01209