(884,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',721,'couldn''t have said it better myself','그보다 더 잘 말할 수 없다, 내 말이 바로 그거다','최고의 동의 couldn''t have said it better myself','상대의 말이 내 생각을 완벽하게 표현했을 때 "나라도 그보다 잘 말 못 했겠다"며 전적으로 동의하는 표현이다. 단순한 동의를 넘어 상대의 표현력까지 칭찬하는 뉘앙스가 있다. 격식·비격식 어디서나 무난하게 쓸 수 있다.','Group projects are just four people doing one person''s job.','조별 과제는 그냥 한 사람 몫을 네 명이 하는 거야.','Couldn''t have said it better myself.','그보다 더 잘 말할 수가 없네.',ARRAY['Couldn''t','have','said','it','better','myself']::varchar[],ARRAY['say','yourself','myself','it','Couldn''t','said','better','have','best']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Wow, couldn''t have said it better myself.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t have said it better myself", "sentenceTranslation": "와, 내 말이 딱 그거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Traveling is the only thing you buy that makes you richer.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "여행은 살수록 부자가 되는 유일한 소비야.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/884/practice-examples/3a68de0e-02d1-48da-bf56-30f7d4d92280.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Wow", "couldn''t", "have", "said", "it", "better", "myself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it", "have", "Wow", "better", "said", "yourself", "best", "say", "couldn''t", "myself"]}, {"sentenceText": "Good. You couldn''t have said it better.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t have said it better", "sentenceTranslation": "잘했어. 그보다 잘 말할 순 없었을 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "I told the landlord the heater situation is unacceptable.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "집주인한테 난방 상태는 말이 안 된다고 했어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/884/practice-examples/4519cfca-eebb-456e-8ecf-818bbcc334e4.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Good", "You", "couldn''t", "have", "said", "it", "better"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["You", "better", "said", "have", "best", "it", "couldn''t", "Good", "say", "has"]}, {"sentenceText": "Honestly, I couldn''t have said it better myself.", "highlightingPart": "couldn''t have said it better myself", "sentenceTranslation": "솔직히 저라도 그보다 잘 말 못 했을 거예요.", "practiceQuestion": "Was my summary of the article okay?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "제 기사 요약 괜찮았나요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/884/practice-examples/74f019f5-fdd2-4040-a1a2-007505c4512f.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Honestly", "I", "couldn''t", "have", "said", "it", "better", "myself"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["better", "myself", "yourself", "said", "it", "best", "I", "say", "have", "couldn''t", "Honestly"]}, {"sentenceText": "Couldn''t have said it better myself. Let''s start early this time.", "highlightingPart": "Couldn''t have said it better myself", "sentenceTranslation": "완전 내 말이 그거야. 이번엔 일찍 시작하자.", "practiceQuestion": "Cramming just trades sleep for grades you forget anyway.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "벼락치기는 어차피 까먹을 성적이랑 잠을 맞바꾸는 거야.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/884/practice-examples/296f8059-048d-4845-8175-00b697e3320c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Couldn''t", "have", "said", "it", "better", "myself", "Let''s", "start", "early", "this", "time"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["starts", "say", "it", "best", "start", "early", "have", "time", "Let''s", "Couldn''t", "myself", "said", "this", "better"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0297241211,-0.0437927246,-0.0581970215,0.0356445312,0.0439758301,-0.0143280029,0.000611782074,0.0418701172,-0.0322265625,0.0047492981,0.0108413696,-0.0118408203,-0.00871276855,-0.0256652832,0.0221252441,-0.0333251953,-0.0514221191,-0.0164337158,0.0501708984,0.0323486328,0.044708252,0.00971984863,0.0117492676,0.0611877441,0.0207824707,-0.00727462769,-0.00421905518,0.0108032227,0.035736084,0.0146179199,-0.0194549561,-0.0182800293,0.0221099854,-0.0486755371,0.00374031067,0.0401611328,0.00983428955,-0.0171661377,0.00452423096,-0.0393676758,0.030456543,-0.0243988037,0.051940918,0.0380859375,0.0267028809,-0.0327148438,-0.017288208,-0.00775146484,0.00936126709,-0.016113281