(886,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',723,'you took the words right out of my mouth','내가 하려던 말이야','말 뺏겼네 you took the words right out of my mouth','내가 막 하려던 말을 상대가 먼저 했을 때 쓰는 표현이다. 직역하면 "내 입에서 말을 꺼내 갔다"인데, 한국어의 "내 말 뺏어 갔네"와 감각이 거의 같다. 동의와 반가움이 동시에 담긴 리액션이라 대화 분위기를 부드럽게 만든다.','I was thinking we should split the cleaning by weeks.','청소를 주 단위로 나누면 어떨까 생각했어.','You took the words right out of my mouth.','딱 내가 하려던 말이야.',ARRAY['You','took','the','words','right','out','of','my','mouth']::varchar[],ARRAY['mouth','right','took','take','You','of','my','out','word','the','words','mine']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "You took the words right out of my mouth.", "highlightingPart": "You took the words right out of my mouth", "sentenceTranslation": "내가 지금 그 말 하려고 했어.", "practiceQuestion": "Should we tell him the surprise party is off?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "걔한테 깜짝 파티 취소됐다고 말할까?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/886/practice-examples/6e778e85-5548-4df8-91f8-d741307a29a0.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You", "took", "the", "words", "right", "out", "of", "my", "mouth"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["took", "mouth", "take", "word", "right", "my", "the", "out", "of", "words", "mine", "You"]}, {"sentenceText": "You took the words out of my mouth. Let''s book a table.", "highlightingPart": "You took the words out of my mouth", "sentenceTranslation": "내 말을 뺏어 갔네. 자리 잡자.", "practiceQuestion": "This cafe would be perfect for our study group.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이 카페 우리 스터디 하기 딱이겠다.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/886/practice-examples/59f18604-7dcc-4d06-9b5c-fb8f3c173d07.webp", "sentenceWords": ["You", "took", "the", "words", "out", "of", "my", "mouth", "Let''s", "book", "a", "table"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["out", "Let''s", "mouth", "take", "table", "booked", "You", "took", "word", "my", "a", "words", "the", "of", "book"]}, {"sentenceText": "You just took the words right 