(954,NULL,'CONVERSATION_SKILL','SLANG_NEOLOGISM','EN','KR',791,'it''s a thing','그거 실제로 있는 거야','그거 진짜 있어 it''s a thing','낯선 유행이나 현상이 실제로 존재한다고 알려 줄 때 쓰는 표현이다. "그거 내가 지어낸 게 아니라 진짜 있는 문화·현상이야"라는 뉘앙스로, "Is that a thing?(그런 게 있어?)" 하고 물을 수도 있다. 캐주얼한 대화용이라 격식 있는 글에는 어울리지 않는다.','Wait, people pay for cuddle cafes? Is that real?','잠깐, 사람들이 포옹 카페에 돈을 낸다고? 그게 진짜야?','Yeah, it''s a thing. There''s one downtown.','응, 진짜 있는 거야. 시내에 하나 있어.',ARRAY['Yeah','it''s','a','thing','There''s','one','downtown']::varchar[],ARRAY['There''s','its','it''s','one','downtown','Yeah','Theirs','things','a','thing']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "It''s a thing now. You even have to book them.", "highlightingPart": "It''s a thing", "sentenceTranslation": "요즘 그게 진짜 유행이야. 예약까지 해야 돼.", "practiceQuestion": "Do people seriously nap in those library pods?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "사람들이 진짜 도서관 캡슐에서 낮잠을 자?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/954/practice-examples/1c1a320a-3efb-4554-b96e-c55e6f907f14.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "a", "thing", "now", "You", "even", "have", "to", "book", "them"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["to", "thing", "even", "Its", "things", "them", "You", "books", "a", "now", "It''s", "book", "have"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m not! It''s totally a thing in Europe.", "highlightingPart": "It''s totally a thing", "sentenceTranslation": "아니라니까! 유럽에선 완전 흔한 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Silent discos? You''re making that up.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "무소음 디스코? 너 지어내는 거지.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/954/practice-examples/6f535396-503e-414f-874f-25a5e5db3d7b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "not", "It''s", "totally", "a", "thing", "in", "Europe"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["no", "a", "Europe", "total", "I''m", "its", "in", "totally", "thing", "not", "It''s"]}, {"sentenceText": "It was a whole thing on social media last year.", "highlightingPart": "It was a whole thing", "sentenceTranslation": "작년에 SNS에서 진짜 난리였던 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Is \"girl dinner\" an actual trend?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "\"걸 디너\"가 진짜 유행이야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/954/practice-examples/1e31db97-986c-410b-8ddd-5a54f7c6c711.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It", "was", "a", "whole", "thing", "on", "social", "media", "last", "year"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["last", "on", "It", "year", "media", "were", "a", "hole", "social", "was", "whole", "thing", "years"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s a thing at some universities, believe it or not.", "highlightingPart": "It''s a thing", "sentenceTranslation": "믿기 힘들겠지만 몇몇 대학엔 진짜 있어.", "practiceQuestion": "Can you actually major in video games?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "게임을 전공으로 할 수가 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/954/practice-examples/61624a6c-2629-4a3b-9a97-286d3e7be1bd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "a", "thing", "at", "some", "universities", "believe", "it", "or", "not"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["believe", "or", "universities", "not", "a", "it", "university", "its", "It''s", "thing", "at", "some", "believes"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[-0.037109375,0.0226745605,-0.0495300293,0.0127944946,0.047088623,-0.0442199707,0.0133743286,-0.0110321045,0.0426940918,-0.0213165283,0.0323486328,-0.00727462769,0.0083770752,-0.0782470703,-0.0348205566,0.029510498,-0.0602722168,0.00704574585,0.0107727051,-0.00200843811,0.0550537109,0.0118713379,-0.00988006592,0.0206451416,0.022857666,-0.00503540039,-0.0207061768,0.0222625732,0.0106811523,0.00580596924,0.00630569458,-0.0270690918,0.036895752,-0.0375061035,0.0124816895,0.0350341797,0.0117721558,0.0135803223,-0.00621795654,-0.0696411133,0.0253753662,0.0200805664,0.0217895508,-0.0229492188,0.00546264648,0.0259857178,-0.0354614258,0.0525817871,-0.0289001465,0.0250091553,0.00714874268,0.0372619629,-0.0223846436,0.0586242676,-0.00891113281,0.00798797607,0.00289726257,0.0433349609,0.000660419464,-0.0313720703,-