(969,NULL,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','CLASSIC_COMMON','EN','KR',806,'it was fun while it lasted','짧았지만 즐거웠다','짧아서 아쉬운 마무리 it was fun while it lasted','좋았던 일이 끝났을 때 미련 대신 "지속되는 동안은 즐거웠다"고 담백하게 정리하는 표현이다. 방학, 연휴, 짧게 끝난 유행 등에 두루 쓰이며, 살짝 자조 섞인 농담으로도 자주 나온다. 아쉬움은 있지만 쿨하게 받아들이는 태도가 핵심이다.','I can''t believe the festival is already over.','축제가 벌써 끝났다니 믿기지가 않아.','Well, it was fun while it lasted.','뭐, 짧았지만 즐거웠다.',ARRAY['Well','it','was','fun','while','it','lasted']::varchar[],ARRAY['last','were','while','it','was','fun','lasted','Well','funny','it']::varchar[],NULL,'[{"sentenceText": "Ugh, it was fun while it lasted.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun while it lasted", "sentenceTranslation": "아, 짧았지만 즐거웠다.", "practiceQuestion": "Winter break ends tomorrow. Back to 8 a.m. classes.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "겨울방학 내일 끝이야. 다시 아침 8시 수업이다.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/969/practice-examples/75dbb433-6294-4a96-bfe9-fa3bbb571a7c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Ugh", "it", "was", "fun", "while", "it", "lasted"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Ugh", "while", "last", "were", "funny", "it", "fun", "it", "was", "lasted"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yeah, it was fun while it lasted. I''ll miss their scones.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun while it lasted", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 있는 동안 참 좋았는데. 거기 스콘 그리울 거야.", "practiceQuestion": "Heard your favorite café is closing next month.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너 최애 카페 다음 달에 문 닫는다며.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/969/practice-examples/83e2651b-59e8-49a2-a32c-e61923520a50.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yeah", "it", "was", "fun", "while", "it", "lasted", "I''ll", "miss", "their", "scones"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["while", "was", "scones", "last", "there", "it", "their", "it", "miss", "Yeah", "I''ll", "fun", "funny", "lasted"]}, {"sentenceText": "It lasted four days, but hey, it was fun while it lasted.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun while it lasted", "sentenceTranslation": "4일 갔지, 근데 뭐, 그동안은 즐거웠어.", "practiceQuestion": "So the whole dorm gave up on the 6 a.m. workout plan?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그래서 기숙사 전체가 아침 6시 운동 계획 포기한 거야?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/969/practice-examples/9ff5e19d-9dd5-4823-a456-4f072557fb47.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It", "lasted", "four", "days", "but", "hey", "it", "was", "fun", "while", "it", "lasted"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["fun", "but", "it", "four", "It", "lasted", "last", "day", "days", "lasted", "while", "hey", "funny", "was", "it"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yep. It was fun while it lasted, and we''re proud anyway.", "highlightingPart": "It was fun while it lasted", "sentenceTranslation": "응. 짧았지만 즐거웠고, 그래도 뿌듯해.", "practiceQuestion": "Your team got knocked out of the tournament already?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "너희 팀 벌써 토너먼트에서 탈락했어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/expressions/969/practice-examples/ada289be-26f4-4cc1-a63e-a38e0d07d17e.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yep", "It", "was", "fun", "while", "it", "lasted", "and", "we''re", "proud", "anyway"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["and", "we''re", "it", "funny", "was", "Yep", "It", "last", "proud", "anyway", "fun", "while", "proudly", "lasted"]}]'::jsonb,'FREE_TALK','ACTIVE',now(),now(),'[0.0266876221,-0.0138320923,-0.0291748047,-0.0477600098,-0.0057258606,0.000213027,-0.0180358887,0.0176849365,0.00249290466,0.0432434082,0.0394592285,-0.0178985596,-0.0026550293,-0.0264892578,0.0304260254,0.0459899902,-0.0196838379,-0.0129928589,0.00178718567,0.0129165649,0.00905609131,0.0171356201,-0.0149765015,0.000838756561,-0.0172119141,-0.0048828125,-0.0367736816,0.0200805664,0.0571899414,-0.0381774902,-0.00755691528,-0.0259094238,0.0229187012,-0.0250549316,-0.00793457031,0.0415344238,0.039276123,-0.0403747559,-0.000241756439,-0.0414428711,0.028717041,-0.0288391113,0.024810791,0.0152359009,0.02734375,2.59876251e-05,0.000977516174,0.0288238525,0.030670166,0.0380249023,0.00971221924,0.068359375,-0.